t("Adventurer", "冒険者", "birth descriptor name")
t("Adventurers can learn to do a bit of everything, getting training in whatever they happen to find.", "　冒険者はあらゆる技術を一定の水準で習得できます。見出した技術を何であれ身に着けてしまえるのです。", "_t")
t("#{bold}##GOLD#This is a bonus class for winning the game.  It is by no means balanced.#WHITE##{normal}#", "#{bold}##GOLD#　これは勝利者用のボーナスクラスです。バランス調整は全く考えられていません。#WHITE##{normal}#", "_t")
t("Their most important stats depend on what they wish to do.", "　重要な能力値は成長の方向性に依存します。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Strength, +2 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋２　機敏＋２　耐久＋２", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, +2 Willpower, +2 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋２　意志＋２　賢さ＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")
t("Wanderer seed", "風来坊シード値", "birth facial category")
t("Wanderer", "風来坊", "birth descriptor name")
t("Wanderers are adventurers who embrace the chaotic nature of the world. They start the game with the Combat Training talent tree, 3 random class trees and 1 random generic tree.", "　風来坊はこの世界の混沌とした本質を良しとする冒険者です。「戦闘訓練」とランダムなクラスタレント系ツリー３種、ジェネリックタレント系ツリーを１種をゲーム開始時に習得しています。", "_t")
t("#{bold}##PURPLE#Every 5 levels they gain a new unlocked class tree, at random.#{normal}##LAST#", "#{bold}##PURPLE#　５レベル毎にクラスタレント系ツリーを１つ、アンロックした状態でランダムに習得します。#{normal}##LAST#", "_t")
t("#{bold}##PURPLE#Every 10 levels starting at level 2 they gain a new unlocked generic tree, at random.#{normal}##LAST#", "#{bold}##PURPLE#　レベル２から１０レベル毎にジェネリックタレント系ツリーを１つ、アンロックした状態でランダムに習得します。#{normal}##LAST#", "_t")
t("#{bold}##GOLD#This is a bonus class for the chaotically inclined. It is by no means balanced, fun or winnable, it is most of all #{italic}#RANDOM#{bold}#.#WHITE##{normal}#", "#{bold}##GOLD#　これはランダム性の強いプレイをしたい時のボーナスクラスです。バランス調整はしていませんし、楽しいとか勝利できるかどうかも意図していません。全くもって#{italic}#ランダム#{bold}#なのです。#WHITE##{normal}#", "_t")
t("Their most important stats depend on what they get to do.", "　重要な能力値はどんなタレントを習得するかに依存します。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#As you level up you learn the talent tree: #LIGHT_BLUE#%s", "#GOLD#　レベルアップで以下のツリーを習得：#LIGHT_BLUE#%s", "say")
t("Wanderer Seed", "風来坊シード値", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/afflicted.lua"

t("Afflicted", "呪怨", "birth descriptor name")
t("Some walk in shadow, alone, unloved, unwanted. What powers they wield may be mighty, but their names are forever cursed.", "　闇の中をただ独り彷徨う者。手にした力は大きいが、その名は永久に呪われることとなった。", "_t")
t("Afflicted classes have been twisted by their association with evil forces.", "　呪怨系のクラスは悪しき力で人生を狂わされた者たちです。", "_t")
t("They can use these forces to their advantage, but at a cost...", "　同種の力を活用しますが、その代償として・・・", "_t")
t("Cursed", "呪怨戦士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Affliction can run to the soul, and hatred can fill one's entire being. Overcome someone else's hated curse to know its dreaded meaning.", "　苦悩が心を占め、憎悪が体を支配する。怒れる者に安らかな死を。恐るべき呪いの本質を知れ。", "_t")
t("Through ignorance, greed or folly the Cursed served some dark design and are now doomed to pay for their sins.", "　無知、欲望、愚かさ。理由はそれぞれ違えども悪に加担し、その報いを受けた者たちです。", "_t")
t("Their only master now is the hatred they carry for every living thing.", "　今ではただ生きとし生けるものに対する憎悪に突き動かされています。", "_t")
t("Drawing strength from the death of all they encounter, the Cursed become terrifying combatants.", "　呪怨戦士は出会う者を片端から殺して自らの糧とし、血も凍る戦闘鬼と化すクラスです。", "_t")
t("Worse, any who approach the Cursed can be driven mad by their terrible aura.", "　その上、近寄る者は尽く恐ろしいオーラに囚われ正気を失うでしょう。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Willpower", "　腕力と意志が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋５", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +4 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")
t("Doomed", "末路人", "birth descriptor name")
t("In shaded places in unknown lands thou must overcome thyself and see thy doom.", "　未知なる地、光無き部屋にて己の影を討ち果たせ。自らの末路を悟るがいい。", "_t")
t("The Doomed are fallen mages who once wielded powerful magic wrought by ambition and dark bargains.", "　「末路人」は魔法使いの成れの果てです。野心を抱き邪悪な力に手を染めたことで、一度は強大な魔力を得ました。", "_t")
t("Stripped of their magic by the dark forces that once served them, they have learned to harness the hatred that burns in their minds.", "　支配していた闇の力に魔力を奪われたため、自らの強烈な憎悪を操る術を習得したのです。", "_t")
t("Only time will tell if they can choose a new path or are doomed forever.", "　更生するのかそれとも永遠に呪われたままなのか。それは誰にもわかりません。", "_t")
t("The Doomed strike from behind a veil of darkness or a host of shadows.", "　闇の帳や影の僕を盾にして、攻撃を仕掛けます。", "_t")
t("They feed upon their enemies as they unleash their minds on all who confront them.", "　敵を糧としつつ、立ちはだかる者全てに精神力を解き放ちます。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Willpower and Cunning", "　意志と賢さが重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +4 Willpower, +5 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋４　賢さ＋５", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/celestial.lua"

t("Celestial", "天球", "birth descriptor name")
t("The magic of the heavens is known to but a few, and that knowledge has long passed east, forgotten.", "　星々の魔術を知る者はごく一部。その知識はとうに失伝し、東方に残るのみ。", "_t")
t("Celestial classes are arcane users focused on the heavenly bodies.", "　天球系のクラスは星々の力を操ることに特化した魔法使いです。", "_t")
t("Most draw their powers from the Sun and the Moons.", "　大抵は太陽と二つの月の力を借りて戦います。", "_t")
t("Sun Paladin", "太陽の騎士", "birth descriptor name")
t("The sun rises in the east in full glory, but you must look for it first amidst the darkest places.", "　太陽は東より燦然と昇る。されどまずは日の差さぬ場所で光を求めねばならぬ。", "_t")
t("Sun Paladins hail from the Gates of Morning, the last bastion of the free people in the Far East.", "　太陽の騎士は東方における自由の民の最後の砦、暁の門出身です。", "_t")
t("Their way of life is well represented by their motto 'The Sun is our giver, our purity, our essence. We carry the light into dark places, and against our strength none shall pass.'", "　その生き様は彼らの座右の銘を聞けばよく分かります。「太陽は我らが源。法にして命。闇の中に光をもたらし、この力で如何なる敵も退けよう」", "_t")
t("They can channel the power of the Sun to smite all who seek to destroy the Sunwall.", "　彼らは太陽の力を借りて、太陽の壁に仇為す者を打ち据えます。", "_t")
t("Competent in both weapon and shield combat and magic, they usually burn their foes from afar before bashing them in melee.", "　武器と盾の扱いに習熟しており、魔法も得意です。そのため遠距離から敵を炎で包み、それから間合いを詰めて叩きのめします。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Magic", "　腕力と魔力が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋５", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")
t("Anorithil", "アノーリシル", "birth descriptor name")
t("The balance of the heavens' powers is a daunting task. Mighty are those that stand in the twilight places, wielding both light and darkness in their mind.", "　星々の平衡を保つのは骨の折れる仕事だ。強きかな薄明の中に立つ者。光と闇の双方を心の中に携えし者よ。", "_t")
t("Anorithils hail from the Gates of Morning, the last bastion of the free people in the Far East.", "　アノーリシルは東方における自由の民の最後の砦、暁の門出身です。", "_t")
t("Their way of life is well represented by their motto 'We stand betwixt the Sun and Moon, where light and darkness meet. In the grey twilight we seek our destiny.'", "　その生き様は彼らの座右の銘でよく分かります。「我ら月と太陽の狭間、光と闇が出会う場所に立つ者。仄暗い薄明の中に己が定めを見出す者なり」", "_t")
t("They can channel the power of the Sun and the Moons to burn and tear apart all who seek to destroy the Sunwall.", "　太陽と二つの月の力を借り、太陽の壁に仇為す者を滅ぼします。", "_t")
t("Masters of Sun and Moon magic, they usually burn their foes with Sun rays before calling the fury of the stars.", "　太陽と月の魔法を極めている術師で、陽光で敵を焼き尽くしては月の怒りを下します。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Cunning", "　魔力と賢さが重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +6 Magic, +0 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋６　賢さ＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/chronomancer.lua"

t("Chronomancer", "時間", "birth descriptor name")
t("Some do not walk upon the straight road others follow. Seek the hidden paths outside the normal course of life.", "　真っすぐな道を外れ、常人と歩みを異にする者もいる。常なる生の外に隠れた小道を求めよ。", "_t")
t("Exploiting a hole in the fabric of spacetime, Chronomancers learn to pull threads from other timelines into their own.", "　時間系のクラスは時空間という布に空いた穴を活用し、他の時間軸から自分のいる方へその繊維を引っ張る術を学びます。", "_t")
t("Pulling these threads creates tension and the harder they pull the more tension is produced.", "　この作業を行うと時空が張り詰めます。強く引くほど、その張り詰め方も大きくなっていくのです。", "_t")
t("Constantly they manage this tension, which they call Paradox, to avoid or control the anomalies they inevitably unleash on the world around them.", "　彼らはこうした時空の緊張状態をパラドックスと呼び、常に管理に努めています。必然的に周囲へ発生する異常事態を回避し、あるいは制御しています。", "_t")
t("Paradox Mage", "パラドックスメイジ", "birth descriptor name")
t("A hand may clap alone if it returns to clap itself. Search for the power in the paradox.", "　右手が右手に立ち戻れば響き渡る隻手の音声。逆説の力を探し求めよ。", "_t")
t("A Paradox Mage studies the very fabric of spacetime, learning not just to bend it but shape it and remake it.", "　パラドックスメイジは時空間という布地そのものを研究しています。そのため時空を歪ませる技、ひいては作り替えたり修復する技術を習得します。", "_t")
t("Most Paradox Mages lack basic skills that others take for granted (like general fighting sense), but they make up for it through control of cosmic forces.", "　彼らのほとんどは他のクラスが当たり前に習得している技術（基本的な戦闘知識など）と無縁です。その欠点を宇宙の力を行使して補います。", "_t")
t("Paradox Mages start off with knowledge of all but the most complex Chronomantic schools.", "　スタート時に一部の高等技術を除き、時間操作の技能をほとんど会得した状態です。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Willpower", "　魔力と意志が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *耐久＋２", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Magic, +2 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋５　意志＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")
t("Temporal Warden", "時の守護者", "birth descriptor name")
t("We preserve the past to protect the future. The hands of time are guarded by the arms of war.", "　過去を守護し、未来を守る。時の御手を守るは戦士の腕。", "_t")
t("Their lifelines braided, Temporal Wardens have learned to work with their other selves across multiple timelines.", "　時の守護者は複雑怪奇な生を送る者たちです。幾つもの時間軸に存在する、自分自身と協力して戦う技術を身に着けています。", "_t")
t("Through their study of chronomancy, they learn to blend archery and dual-weapon fighting, seamlessly switching from one to the other.", "　時間操作の技術を研究し、弓と二刀流を組み合わせた戦闘法を習得しました。その二つを瞬時に切り替えながら戦います。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic, Dexterity, and Willpower", "　魔力、機敏、意志が重要となります。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *機敏＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +2 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋４　意志＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/corrupted.lua"

t("Defiler", "邪悪", "birth descriptor name")
t("Dark thoughts, black bloods, vile deeds... Those who spill their brethren's blood will find its power.", "　邪悪な心と黒き血潮。手に染めるはおぞましき所業かな・・・同胞の血を流す者はその力を掴み取る。", "_t")
t("Defilers are touched by the mark of evil. They are a blight on the world. Working to promote the cause of evil, they serve their masters, or themselves become masters.", "　邪悪系のクラスは悪の道に足を踏み入れた者たち。世を蝕む存在です。邪悪な勢力のためにその身を捧げ、主に尽くしています。あるいは取って代わらんがために。", "_t")
t("Reaver", "魔戦士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Reap thee the souls of thine enemies, and the powers of darkness shall enter thy flesh.", "　汝が敵の魂を刈り取れ。さすれば闇の力がその身に宿るだろう。", "_t")
t("Reavers are terrible foes, charging their enemies with a weapon in each hand.", "　魔戦士は厄介な相手です。両の手に一つずつ武器を携えて敵に襲い掛かります。", "_t")
t("They can harness the blight of evil, infecting their foes with terrible contagious diseases while crushing their skulls with devastating combat techniques.", "　悪疫を操る力を有し、敵対する者を恐ろしい伝染病で侵しては、強烈な技でその頭蓋を叩き割るのです。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Magic", "　腕力と魔力が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋４　機敏＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")
t("Corruptor", "腐敗術師", "birth descriptor name")
t("Blight and depravity hold the greatest powers. Accept temptation and become one with corruption.", "　真の力は穢れと堕落の中にあり。誘惑に応え、堕ちたる者となるのだ。", "_t")
t("A corruptor is a terrible foe, wielding dark magics that can sap the very soul of her target.", "　腐敗術師は実に厄介な相手です。邪悪な魔術の数々で敵の命そのものを吸い取ってしまいます。", "_t")
t("They can harness the blight of evil, crushing souls, stealing life force to replenish themselves.", "　汚れた力を操り、魂を破壊して生命力を掠め取ります。それにより活力を得るのです。", "_t")
t("The most powerful corruptors can even take on some demonic aspects for themselves.", "　達人ともなれば己が為、部分的に魔神に変ずることすら可能です。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Willpower", "　魔力と意志が重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *耐久＋２", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +3 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋４　意志＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/mage.lua"

t("Mage", "魔導士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Mages are the wielders of arcane powers, able to cast powerful spells of destruction or to heal their wounds with nothing but a thought.", "　魔導士系クラスは神秘の力を操ります。強力な破壊の術や癒しの魔法を、意のままに行使するのです。", "_t")
t("Golem", "ゴーレム", "birth facial category")
t("Alchemist", "錬金術師", "birth descriptor name")
t("An Alchemist is a manipulator of materials using magic.", "　錬金術師は魔法で物質を操作します。", "_t")
t("They do not use the forbidden arcane arts practised by the mages of old - such perverters of nature have been shunned or actively hunted down since the Spellblaze.", "　昔ながらの魔法使いが扱う、忌まわしい魔術は用いません。自然法則をそのように歪める者たちは魔法大禍以来、迫害ないしは積極的に処刑されてきました。", "_t")
t("Alchemists can transmute gems to bring forth elemental effects, turning them into balls of fire, torrents of acid, and other effects.  They can also reinforce armour with magical effects using gems, and channel arcane staffs to produce bolts of energy.", "　このクラスは宝石を変質させて元素の力を生み出します。火球や酸のシャワーなどに変化させるのです。また、宝石を用いて鎧に魔法の力を付与したり、杖の力を引き出してエネルギーの矢を放つことも。", "_t")
t("Though normally physically weak, most alchemists are accompanied by magical golems which they construct and use as bodyguards.  These golems are enslaved to their master's will, and can grow in power as their master advances through the arts.", "　錬金術師は大抵の場合ひ弱です。しかし大抵の場合、魔法のゴーレムを従えています。自ら作り上げたゴーレムを護衛に使っているというわけです。このゴーレムは主人の命令には絶対服従し、作り手の技術が向上するに伴い力を増していきます。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Constitution", "　魔力と耐久が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +3 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *耐久＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Magic, +1 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋５　意志＋１", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -1", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#－１", "_t")
t("Golem becomes a Drolem", "ドローレムに改造", "_t")
t("Archmage", "魔導士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Hated, harrowed, hunted, hidden... Our ways are forbidden, but our cause is just. In our veiled valley we find solace from the world's wrath, free to study our arts. Only through charity and friendship can you earn our trust.", "　世の非難に苦しみ、追われ、姿を隠した・・・禁じられし道を歩めども、大義に恥じるところなし。人目届かぬ谷間に静謐の地あり。心のままに魔術の探求が許される里。形を以て友誼を示さねば我らが信は得られない。", "_t")
t("An Archmage devotes his whole life to the study of magic above anything else.", "　魔導士は人生を魔術の探求に捧げる者たちです。", "_t")
t("Most Archmagi lack basic skills that others take for granted (like general fighting sense), but they make up for it by their raw magical power.", "　彼らのほとんどは他のクラスが当たり前に習得している技術（基本的な戦闘知識など）と無縁です。しかしそれを純粋な魔法の力で補っています。", "_t")
t("Archmagi start with knowledge of many schools of magic. However, they usually refuse to have anything to do with Necromancy.", "　スタート時に幅広い分野の魔法知識を有しています。しかし死霊術にだけは断固として手を染めません。", "_t")
t("Most Archmagi have been trained in the secret town of Angolwen and possess a unique spell to teleport to it directly.", "　大抵の場合、魔導士は隠れ里アンゴルウェンで修行を積んでおり、そこへ直接転移する独自の術が使えます。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Willpower", "　魔力と意志が重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Magic, +3 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋５　意志＋３　賢さ＋１", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -4", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# -4", "_t")
t("Necromancer", "死霊術師", "birth descriptor name")
t("The road to necromancy is a macabre path indeed. Walk with the dead, and drink deeply of their black knowledge.", "　死霊術は真におぞましき技芸。死者と共に歩み、黒き知識を飲み干すのだ。", "_t")
t("While most magic is viewed with suspicion since the Spellblaze, the stigma surrounding the black art of Necromancy has been around since time immemorial.", "　魔法のほとんどは魔法大禍以来、嫌疑の目を向けられています。しかし死霊術は気の遠くなるような昔より、忌まわしい逸話を残してきました。", "_t")
t("These dark spellcasters extinguish life, twist death, and raise armies of undead monsters to sate their lust for power and pursue their ultimate goal: Eternal life.", "　これなる闇の術師たちは命を踏みにじり、死を弄び、死者の軍勢を呼び覚ましては力への渇望を満たしていきます。その最終目的は「永遠の命」です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -3", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#－３", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/none.lua"

t("None", "なし", "birth descriptor name")
t("Your race cannot select a class; it has its own powers.", "　現在の種族ではクラス選択は出来ません。種族固有の能力を有しています。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/psionic.lua"

t("Psionic", "超能力", "birth descriptor name")
t("Weakness of flesh can be overcome by mental prowess. Find the way and fight for the way to open the key to your mind.", "　肉体の弱さは精神力で補える。道を見出し、道のために戦え。それが心の扉を開く鍵だ。", "_t")
t("Psionics find their power within themselves. Their highly trained minds can harness energy from many different sources and manipulate it to produce physical effects.", "　超能力系のクラスは内なる力を頼みとしています。高度に発達した精神力で様々な由来のエネルギーを制御し、それらを操作して物理現象を引き起こします。", "_t")
t("Mindslayer", "マインドスレイヤー", "birth descriptor name")
t("A thought can inspire; a thought can kill. After centuries of oppression, years of imprisonment, a thought shall break us free and vengeance will strike from our darkest dreams.", "　想いは人を鼓舞すれば、また殺めることもある。幾世紀にもわたる弾圧。虜囚の歳月。意志の力が我らを自由にするだろう。眠りの底から復讐が幕を開けるのだ。", "_t")
t("Mindslayers specialize in direct and brutal application of mental forces to their immediate surroundings.", "　マインドスレイヤーは精神力を直截的な形で振い、周囲に破壊をもたらすスペシャリストです。", "_t")
t("When Mindslayers do battle, they will most often be found in the thick of the fighting, vast energies churning around them and telekinetically-wielded weapons hewing nearby foes at the speed of thought.", "　戦いとなれば一番の激戦区に身を投じていることでしょう。その周囲ではエネルギーが渦巻き、念動力で動く武器が思考の速度で飛び交っています。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Willpower and Cunning", "　意志と賢さが重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +1 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +4 Willpower, +4 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋４　賢さ＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#－２", "_t")
t("Solipsist", "ソリプシスト", "birth descriptor name")
t("Some believe that the world is the collective dream of those that live in it.  Find and wake the sleeper and you'll unlock the potential of your dreams.", "　世界とはそこに住まう者たちの夢が集まってできていると考える者もいる。夢見人を探し、その目を覚ませ。夢の秘める力が解き放たれるだろう。", "_t")
t("The Solipsist believes that reality is malleable and nothing more than the collective vision of those that experience it.", "　現実は不安定なもの、とソリプシスト達は考えています。体験する者たちの主観が合わさったものに過ぎないのだと。", "_t")
t("They wield this knowledge to both create and destroy, to invade the minds of others, and to manipulate the dreams of those around them.", "　彼らはこの知識を用いて破壊と創造を行います。他者の精神に侵入し、夢を操るのです。", "_t")
t("This knowledge comes with a heavy price and the Solipsist must guard his thoughts, lest he come to believe that the world exists only within his own mind.", "　この技術には高い代償が伴います。術者は自らの心を守らねばなりません。さもなくば「世界は己の意識の中にだけ存在する」という思考に囚われてしまうでしょう。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +5 Willpower, +4 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋５　賢さ＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -4 (*special*)", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#－４（*特殊*）", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/rogue.lua"

t("Rogue", "盗賊", "birth descriptor name")
t("Rogues are masters of tricks; they can strike from the shadows, and lure monsters into deadly traps.", "　搦手に長けたクラスです。物陰から不意を突いたり、敵をおびき寄せて、凶悪な罠に嵌めます。", "_t")
t("Rogues are masters of tricks. A Rogue can get behind you unnoticed and stab you in the back for tremendous damage.", "　盗賊は搦手の達人です。背後から不意打ちを仕掛けて致命傷を与えます。", "_t")
t("Rogues usually prefer to dual-wield daggers. They can also become trapping experts, detecting and disarming traps as well as setting them.", "　普通は短剣を二刀流して戦うスタイルを好みます。罠の発見と解除、それに設置を行う専門家の道も歩めます。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Dexterity and Cunning", "　機敏と賢さが重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +1 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋１　機敏＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +0 Willpower, +5 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *賢さ＋５", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")
t("Shadowblade", "影法師", "birth descriptor name")
t("Shadowblades are Rogues that are touched by the gift of magic, able to kill with their daggers under a veil of stealth while casting spells to enhance their performance and survival.", "　影法師は魔法の才を有する盗賊です。身を隠しつつ短剣で敵を仕留める一方、魔法を用いて自己強化し生存率を高めます。", "_t")
t("Their use of magic is innate and not really studied; as such they do not naturally regenerate mana and must use external means of recharging.", "　彼らの使う魔法は天賦の才によるもので、きちんと学んだわけではありません。したがってそのままではマナが自動回復せず、充填手段を取り入れる必要があります。", "_t")
t("They use the schools of Phantasm, Temporal, Divination and Conveyance magic to enhance their arts.", "　幻術、時間術、予見術、転移術などの領域を補助として使います。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Dexterity, Cunning and Magic", "　機敏、賢さ、魔力が重要となります。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *機敏＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Magic, +0 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋３　賢さ＋３", "_t")
t("Marauder", "殺手", "birth descriptor name")
t("I will not hide and I will not sneak - come dance with my blades and we'll see who's weak. Snapping bone and cracking skull, it's the sounds of battle that make life full!", "　逃げも隠れもしやしない。この刃に合わせて踊れ。どっちが強いか比べてみようぜ。骨がへし折れ頭蓋が割れる。これぞ生きがい戦場の音！", "_t")
t("The wilds of Maj'Eyal are not a safe place. Untamed beasts and wandering dragons may seem a great threat, but the true perils walk on two legs. Thieves and brigands, assassins and opportunistic adventurers, even mad wizards and magic-hating zealots all carry danger to those who venture beyond the safety of city walls.", "　マイ・イヤルの荒野は安穏とした場所ではありません。野生動物や、徘徊するドラゴン。それらも確かに脅威に映るでしょう。しかし本当に危険な存在は二本の足で歩く者たちです。盗人や追剥。殺し屋に利己的な冒険者たち。その上狂った魔術師や、魔法を目の敵にする狂信者共。安全な城壁からあえて出ようとする者にはこうした面々が襲い掛かってきます。", "_t")
t("Amidst this chaos wanders one class of rogue that has learned to take by force rather than subterfuge. With refined techniques, agile feats and brawn-backed blades the Marauder seeks out his targets and removes them by the most direct methods. He uses dual weapons backed by advanced combat training to become highly effective in battle, and he is unafraid to use the dirtiest tactics when the odds are against him.", "　ある種の盗賊はこの危険極まりない環境を闊歩します。彼らが会得しているのは搦手ではなく、腕力にものを言わせた技術です。手練の技と素早い動きを身に着けた殺手は力に任せて双剣を振い、敵を追い求めます。そして有無を言わさず葬るのです。高度な戦闘技術を用いた二刀流で大暴れするクラスです。いざとなれば眉を顰めるような戦法も厭いません。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength, Dexterity and Cunning", "　腕力、機敏、賢さが重要となります。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Strength, +4 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋４　機敏＋４", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +0 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *賢さ＋１", "_t")
t("Skirmisher", "散兵", "birth descriptor name")
t("Fleet of foot and strong of throw, overwhelming every foe, from afar we counter, strike and thud, in the chaos'd skirmish spilling blood.", "　俊足強肩、向かうところ敵なし。遠間より打ち返すスリングの弾、食らえば重たい音がする。こんな激闘で散兵は相手を仕留めるのだ。", "_t")
t("While able to take maximum advantage of their sling by using deft movements to avoid and confuse enemies that try to get close, the Skirmisher truly excels when fighting other ranged users.", "　散兵は近寄ろうとする敵を素早い動きであしらうことで、スリングの強みを最大限に活かせます。その上、対射撃戦では他の追随を許しません。", "_t")
t("They have mastered the use of their shield as well as their sling and are nearly impossible to defeat in a standoff.", "　スリングの他にも盾の扱いに習熟しており、距離を取って戦えばまず負けることはないでしょう。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +4 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *機敏＋４", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +1 Willpower, +4 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋１　賢さ＋４", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/tutorial.lua"

t("Tutorial Adventurer", "チュートリアル", "birth descriptor name")
t("Adventurers have a generic talent set to teach to young ones.", "　若者が習得すべき一般的なタレントを習得しています。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/warrior.lua"

t("Warrior", "戦士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Warriors train in all aspects of physical combat. They can be juggernauts of destruction wielding two-handed greatswords, or massive iron-clad protectors with gleaming shields.", "　戦士系のクラスは物理的な戦闘技術に精通しています。両手武器を構えて敵をなぎ倒す者。あるいは鉄の具足を纏い、ピカピカの盾を構えて突き進む者。", "_t")
t("Berserker", "狂戦士", "birth descriptor name")
t("A Berserker wields huge two-handed weapons of destruction, bringing pain and death to his foes as he cleaves them in two.", "　狂戦士は凶悪な両手武器を構えて死と苦痛をもたらし、敵を真っ二つにしていきます。", "_t")
t("A Berserker usually forfeits all ideas of self-defense to concentrate on what he does best: killing things.", "　自分の仕事、つまり殺戮に専念するため、防御面を捨て去っていることがほとんどです。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Constitution", "　腕力と耐久が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +3 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋５　機敏＋１　耐久＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋３", "_t")
t("Bulwark", "闘士", "birth descriptor name")
t("A Bulwark specializes in weapon and shield combat, rarely leaving the cover of her many protective techniques.", "　闘士は武器と盾を用いた戦いに特化しています。多種多様な防御技術で常に守りを固めています。", "_t")
t("A good Bulwark is able to withstand terrible attacks from all sides, protected by her shield, and when the time comes lash out at her foes with incredible strength.", "　熟練の闘士は四方八方の猛攻を盾で受け止め、機が満ちれば全力で逆襲に転じます。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Dexterity", "　腕力と機敏が重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Strength, +2 Dexterity, +2 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋５　機敏＋２　耐久＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +6", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋６", "_t")
t("Archer", "射手", "birth descriptor name")
t("Archers are dexterous ranged fighters, able to pin their foes to the ground and rain down a carpet of arrows on them.", "　迅速を旨とする遠距離型の戦士です。敵を地面に縫い留め、矢の雨を降らせます。", "_t")
t("Skilled archers can fire special shots that pierce, cripple or pin their foes.", "　熟達すれば貫通や行動阻害、移動停止の特殊射撃を使用できます。", "_t")
t("Archers can become good with either longbows or slings.", "　弓ではなくスリングを使ってもいいでしょう。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Dexterity and Strength (when using bows) or Cunning (when using slings)", "　機敏が重要で、弓の場合は腕力が、スリングの場合は賢さが必要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Strength, +5 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋２　機敏＋５", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +0 Willpower, +2 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *賢さ＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")
t("Arcane Blade", "魔法剣士", "birth descriptor name")
t("The Arcane Blade is a warrior who has been touched by the gift of magic.", "　魔法剣士は魔法の才を有する戦士です。", "_t")
t("Their use of magic is innate and not really studied; as such they do not naturally regenerate mana and must use external means of recharging.", "　彼らの使う魔法は天賦の才によるもので、きちんと学んだわけではありません。したがってそのままではマナが自動回復せず、充填手段を取り入れる必要があります。", "_t")
t("They can cast spells from a limited selection but have the unique capacity to 'channel' their attack spells through their melee attacks.", "　ある程度魔法を扱うことができますが、攻撃魔法を近接攻撃に「込める」独自の能力を有しています。", "_t")
t("They are adept with two-handed weapons, for the sheer destruction they can bring.", "　完膚なきまでに敵を滅ぼさんと、両手武器の扱いに長けています。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength, Cunning and Magic", "　腕力、賢さ、魔力が重要になります。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Magic, +0 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋３　賢さ＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")
t("Brawler", "格闘士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Though you may fight alone against many, destined to fight till you die, still you do not relent. In a ring of blood you learn that a pair of fists can face the world.", "　独り多勢を相手に、死ぬまで戦う羽目になろうとも闘志を失うな。拳で全てを制す技を、血闘場で知るだろう。", "_t")
t("The ravages of the Spellblaze stretched armies thin and left many unprotected. Not everyone could afford the luxury of a weapon.", "　魔法大禍による甚大な被害で軍隊は手一杯になり、無防備な状態に晒された人々は夥しい数に上りました。", "_t")
t("Without steel or iron, poor communities of all races turned to the strength of their own bodies for defense against the darkness.", "　全員が武器を買えるほど恵まれていたわけではありません。鋼鉄の武具を入手できず、あらゆる種族で貧困層が自衛のために自らの体を鍛えました。", "_t")
t("Whether a pit-fighter, a boxer, or just an amateur practitioner, the Brawler's skills are still handy today.", "　喧嘩屋、拳闘士、殴り合いの素人。いずれにせよ格闘家の技は今日においても無手の技なのです。", "_t")
t("Many of the Brawler's abilities will earn combo points which they can use on finishing moves that will have added effect.", "　格闘家の技は使用するとコンボポイントが発生するものがほとんどです。このポイントは追加効果を持つ必殺技で消費します。", "_t")
t("The unarmed fighting styles the Brawler uses rely on maneuverability and having both hands available. As such, they cannot make use of their training wearing massive armour or while a weapon or shield is equipped.", "　素手で戦うこのスタイルは機動性に依存し、両手が自由な状態を前提としています。プレートアーマーを着ていたり、武器や盾を装備している状態では修行の成果を発揮できません。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength, Dexterity, and Cunning", "　腕力、機敏、賢さが重要になります。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋３　機敏＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +0 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *賢さ＋３", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/wilder.lua"

t("Wilder", "自然", "birth descriptor name")
t("Natural abilities can go beyond mere skill. Experience the true powers of nature to learn of its amazing gifts.", "　大地の御業はただの技術に留まらない。自然界の真なる力を味わい、その妙なる恵みを知れ。", "_t")
t("Wilders are one with nature, in one manner or another. There are as many different Wilders as there are aspects of nature.", "　自然系のクラスはそれぞれやり方は違っても、大地と共に生きる者たちです。自然界に様々な側面があるように、彼らも多種多様です。", "_t")
t("They can take on the aspects of creatures, summon creatures to them, feel the druidic call, ...", "　他の生物に姿を変えたり、動物を召喚したり、大地の声に耳を傾けます・・・", "_t")
t("Summoner", "召喚士", "birth descriptor name")
t("Not all might comes from within. Hear the invocations of nature, hear its calling power. See that from without we can find our true strengths.", "　力は己の内より出ずるとは限らない。大地の声に耳を傾け、その力強き言葉を聞け。無より真の力を得る様を見よ。", "_t")
t("Summoners never fight alone. They are always ready to summon one of their many minions to fight at their side.", "　召喚士は常に仲間を連れて戦うクラスです。無数に存在する配下の中から、いつでも救援を呼ぶことができます。", "_t")
t("Summons can range from a combat hound to a fire drake.", "　近接戦闘を行う狼から火炎竜まで、手下の種類は多彩です。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Willpower and Cunning", "　意志と賢さが重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *機敏＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +5 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋５　賢さ＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# +0", "_t")
t("Max summons: %d", "最大召喚数：%d", "tformat")
t("Wyrmic", "竜化術師", "birth descriptor name")
t("Sleek, majestic, powerful... In the path of dragons we walk, and their breath is our breath. See their beating hearts with your eyes and taste their majesty between your teeth.", "　輝く鱗、尊貴にして強大・・・我ら竜の生を歩む者。彼らの吐息は我らが吐息。竜の脈打つ心臓を目の当たりにし、その偉大さを噛みしめよ。", "_t")
t("Wyrmics are fighters who have learnt how to mimic some of the aspects of the dragons.", "　竜化術師はドラゴンの特質をコピーする技を習得した戦士です。", "_t")
t("They have access to talents normally belonging to the various kind of drakes.", "　彼らが使用できるタレントの数々は、元来様々な種類のドラゴンが使うものです。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Willpower", "　腕力と意志が重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +5 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +1 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋５　耐久＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +3 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +2", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋２", "_t")
t("Oozemancer", "ウーズ使い", "birth descriptor name")
t("Magic must fail, magic must lose, nothing arcane can face the ooze...", "　失せよ魔法。滅びよ魔法。ウーズの前に魔の力は無力なり・・・", "_t")
t("Oozemancers separate themselves from normal civilisation so that they be more in harmony with Nature. Arcane force are reviled by them, and their natural attunement to the wilds lets them do battle with abusive magic-users on an equal footing.", "　ウーズ使いは人里を離れて暮らしています。自然と一体となるためです。彼らは魔法の力を憎んでおり、生来備わった大自然と交信する力で、身勝手な魔法使い達と互角に戦います。", "_t")
t("They can spawn oozes to protect and attack from a distance while also being adept at harnessing the power of mindstars and psiblades.", "　ウーズを生み出して防御や遠距離攻撃に利用する他、マインドスターとサイブレードの制御に長けています。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +5 Willpower, +4 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *意志＋５　賢さ＋４", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -3", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#－３", "_t")
t("Stone Warden", "石の守り手", "birth descriptor name")
t([[The Spellblaze's scars may be starting to heal,
but little can change how the partisans feel.
Nature and arcane could bridge their divide -
and when it comes down to it, gold won't take sides...]], "　魔法大禍の傷は癒え始めていても、狂信者の考えを改めるのは困難だ。自然と魔法を一つにするのは決して無理な話じゃない。つまるところ、金は分け隔てをしないのさ・・・", "_t")
t("Stone Wardens are dwarves trained in both the eldritch arts and the worship of nature.", "　魔法の力と大地との交信、この双方を修めたドワーフです。", "_t")
t("While other races are stuck in their belief that arcane forces and natural forces are meant to oppose, dwarves have found a way to combine them in harmony.", "　他の種族は魔法と自然の力が相反するものと思い込んでいますが、ドワーフ達はその二つを無理なく組み合わせる方法を見出しました。", "_t")
t("Stone Wardens are armoured fighters, dual wielding shields to channel many of their powers.", "　石の守り手は鎧を纏う戦士です。両手に盾を持ち、これを介して様々な力を発揮します。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength, Magic and Willpower", "　腕力、魔力と意志が重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋２", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Magic, +3 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋４　意志＋３", "_t")

