t("Redhead Hair 5", "赤髪５", "_t")
t("Bikini / Mankini", "アブナイ水着", "_t")
t("Shalore", "シャローレ", "birth descriptor name")
t("Shaloren elves have close ties with the magic of the world, and produced in the past many great mages.", "　シャローレのエルフはこの世界における魔法と密接に結びついている種族です。過去に偉大なる魔法使いを何人も輩出しました。", "_t")
t("Yet they remain quiet and try to hide their magic from the world, for they remember too well the Spellblaze - and the Spellhunt that followed.", "　しかし今日では鳴りを潜め、彼らの魔法をどうにかして世間の目から隠そうとしています。魔法大禍の一件については鮮明すぎるほどに記憶しているのです。そのあとに起きた魔法狩りのことも。", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Grace of the Eternals#WHITE# talent which allows them a boost of speed every once in a while.", "　#GOLD#「永久なる恵み」#WHITE#のタレントを有しており、しばらくの間加速できます。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#*腕力－２　機敏＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, +3 Willpower, +1 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE#*魔力＋２　意志＋３　賢さ＋１", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 9", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#９", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 12%", "#GOLD#経験修正：#LIGHT_BLUE#１２％", "_t")
t("Thalore", "タローレ", "birth descriptor name")
t("Thaloren elves have spent most of the ages hidden within their forests, seldom leaving them.", "　タローレのエルフはほぼ森の中に引きこもり、外界に出ることは滅多にありません。", "_t")
t("The ages of the world passed by and yet they remained unchanged.", "　世界が移り変わる中で、彼らは変わらぬ日々を過ごしていたのです。", "_t")
t("Their affinity for nature and their reclusion have made them great protectors of the natural order, often opposing their Shaloren cousins.", "　大地の申し子であり、外界と関わりを断ってきたため、自然界守護の重鎮となりました。類縁たるシャローレと対立することもしばしばです。", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Gift of the Woods#WHITE# talent, which allows them to regenerate life and increase healing once in a while.", "　#GOLD#「森の恵み」#WHITE#の能力を有し、しばしば怪我を自然治癒し、回復力を高めます。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Strength, +3 Dexterity, +1 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋２　機敏＋３　耐久＋１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * -2 Magic, +1 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力－２　意志＋１", "_t")
