section "mod-tome/data/birth/races/giant.lua"

t("Giant", "ジャイアント", "birth descriptor name")
t("Powerful beings that tower over all, but the bigger they are, the harder they fall...", "　全てを見下ろす強大な存在。だが体が大きければ、それだけ倒れた時の痛手も深いものとなる・・・", "_t")
t("#{italic}#\"Giant\"#{normal}# is a catch-all term for humanoids which are typically over eight feet in height.  Their origins, cultures, and relationships to other races differ wildly, but they tend to live as refugees and outcasts, shunned by smaller sentient races who usually see them as a threat.", "　#{italic}#「ジャイアント」#{normal}#とは平均身長が２．４ｍを超える人間型種族に対する大雑把な呼称です。起源や文化、他種族との関係性は種別ごとにまるで違います。ただ、迫害を逃れる立場にあることが多く、彼らをいつも脅威とみなす、体格の劣る知的種族に嫌われています。", "_t")
t("Skin", "皮膚", "birth facial category")
t("Hairs", "髪型", "birth facial category")
t("Facial features", "容貌", "birth facial category")
t("Tatoos", "タトゥー", "birth facial category")
t("Special", "特殊", "birth facial category")
t("Ogre", "オーガ", "birth descriptor name")
t([[Forged in the hatred of ages long passed,
made for a war that they've come to outlast.
Their forgotten birthplace lies deep underground,
its tunnels ruined so it wouldn't be found.
Past burglars have failed, but their data's immortal;
to start, look where halflings once tinkered with portals...]], "　遥かな昔、憎しみ渦巻く時代に創造されし者たち。兵器として生まれ、戦が過ぎ去った今も存続している。知る人もなき生まれ故郷は地の底に。通り道は崩れ落ち、見出すことは叶わない。盗人共の企みは潰えたが、奴らのデータは不滅だ。まずはハーフリング達がポータルの実験をしていた場所を探してみるといい・・・", "_t")
t("Ogres are an altered form of Human, created in the Age of Allure as workers and warriors for the Conclave.", "　オーガは改造人間です。魅惑の時代に秘密会議に尽くす労働者・兵士として創り出されました。", "_t")
t("Inscriptions have granted them magical and physical power far beyond their natural limits, but their dependence on runic magic made them a favored target during the Spellhunt, forcing them to take refuge among the Shalore.", "　封入品の効果で物理的・魔法的な面での強さは人間の限界を凌駕しています。しかしルーン無しでは生きていけないため、魔法狩りでは重点的に狙われる羽目に。シャローレ達の下へ避難を余儀なくされました。", "_t")
t("Their preference for simple and direct solutions has given them an undeserved reputation as dumb brutes, despite their extraordinary talent with runes and their humble, dutiful nature.", "　単純明快な解決手段を好むので、鈍重で粗暴という間違った評判が立っています。ルーン関連では出色の腕前を持ち、謹厳な性格をしているのですが。", "_t")
t("They possess the #GOLD#Ogric Wrath#WHITE# talent, which grants them critical chance and power, as well as resistance to confusion and stuns, when their attacks miss or are blocked.", "　#GOLD#「怒れるオーガ」#WHITE#のタレントを有しており、攻撃を外すかブロックされるかするとクリティカル率と倍率が増加します。さらにスタン・移動不能耐性も上昇します。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, -1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋３　機敏－１", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +2 Magic, -2 Willpower, +2 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋２　意志－２　賢さ＋２", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 13", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#１３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Experience penalty:#LIGHT_BLUE# 15%", "#GOLD#経験修正：#LIGHT_BLUE#１５％", "_t")
