section "mod-tome/data/birth/races/human.lua"

t("Skin", "皮膚", "birth facial category")
t("Hairs", "髪型", "birth facial category")
t("Facial features", "容貌", "birth facial category")
t("Special", "特殊", "birth facial category")
t("Human", "人間", "birth descriptor name")
t("The Humans are one of the main races on Maj'Eyal, along with the Halflings. For many thousands of years they fought each other until events, and great people, unified all the Human and Halfling nations under one rule.", "　人間はハーフリングと同じくマイ・イヤルにおける主要種族の一角です。人間とハーフリングは何千年もの間戦いを繰り広げてきました。いろいろな出来事があり、偉人たちが両種族の国々を一つにまとめ上げたのです。", "_t")
t("Humans of these Allied Kingdoms have known peace for over a century now.", "　この連合王国において、人間族は一世紀あまり平和を享受しています。", "_t")
t("Humans are split into two categories: the Highers, and the rest. Highers have latent magic in their blood which gives them higher attributes and senses along with a longer life.", "　人間族は二種類に分かれています。上級人とその他です。上級人はその血の中に魔法の力を秘めており、優れた特性と鋭い感覚を有しています。その上長寿です。", "_t")
t("The rest of Humanity is gifted with quick learning and mastery. They can do and become anything they desire.", "　その他の人間族は生まれつき高い学習能力の持ち主。望めば何にでもなれるのです。", "_t")
