t("Skin", "皮膚", "birth facial category")
t("Hairs", "髪型", "birth facial category")
t("Facial features", "容貌", "birth facial category")
t("Tatoos", "タトゥー", "birth facial category")
t("Special", "特殊", "birth facial category")
t("Yeek", "イーク", "birth descriptor name")
t("One race, one mind, one way. Our oppression shall end, and we shall inherit Eyal. Do not presume we are weak - our way is true, and only those who help us shall see our strength.", "　一つの種族。一つの精神。一つの道。忍苦の時は終わりを告げる。我らイヤルを継ぐ者。この力を見くびるな。我らが道に誤りはない。我らに助力するものだけが、我らの強さを知るだろう。", "_t")
t("Yeeks are a mysterious race of small humanoids native to the tropical island of Rel.", "　イークは謎に包まれた小柄な人型種族です。南の島レルに生息しています。", "_t")
t("Their body is covered with white fur and their disproportionate heads give them a ridiculous look.", "　全身に白い毛が生えており、不釣り合いに大きな頭が笑いを誘います。", "_t")
t("Although they are now nearly unheard of in Maj'Eyal, they spent many thousand years as secret slaves to the Halfling nation of Nargol.", "　今日、マイ・イヤルでイークの話はほとんど聞きません。しかしナーゴルのハーフリング達は何千年もの間、イークをこっそり奴隷にしていました。", "_t")
t("They gained their freedom during the Age of Pyre and have since then followed 'The Way' - a unity of minds enforced by their powerful psionics.", "　「篝火の時代」においてイークたちは自由を得、それ以来「道」に従っています。「道」とは彼らの強力な超能力で統合された、集合意識です。", "_t")
