section "mod-tome/data/chats/avatar-distant-sun-unlock.chat"

t("Uhh, okay. Sure. Mind showing me?", "「うーん。わかった。そいつを見せてもらえるかな？」", "chat")
t([[<<<You feel a gentle warmth in your mind. Something speaks directly to your mind!>>>
#YELLOW#HELLO FRIEND. I AM A STAR FROM FAR AWAY. I HAVE HEARD YOU PRAISING YOUR SUN. WHY NOT PRAISE ME INSTEAD? I AM A MUCH BETTER SUN THAN THAT DULL, LIFELESS GAS ORB IN YOUR VICINITY. PLEASE, ALLOW ME TO DEMONSTRATE MY GOOD INTENTIONS.]], [[　（頭の中が仄かに暖かくなる。何かが心に直接語り掛けてきた！）
　#YELLOW#「やあ、友ヨ。ワタシは星だ。遥か彼方から呼びかけてイル。キミは太陽を崇めているそうじゃナイカ。ワタシの方に宗旨替えしないカ？　そちらの命なきガス塊など問題にならナイ。ドウカ、敵ではないと解ってもらいタイ」]], "chat")
t("I don't take unsolicited messages from... stars.", "「一方的な・・・星との交信はしたくないんだ」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#YOU ONLY HAD TO ASK, MY FRIEND.", "#YELLOW#「言ってくれればよかったのダ」", "chat")
t("#CRIMSON#[The area around you erupts in flames, burning your foes]", "#CRIMSON#（周囲で炎が爆ぜ、敵が燃え上がった）", "chat")
t("If you say so.", "「そう言うなら」", "chat")
t("Look, I appreciate the offer, but I don't know you.", "「待て、気持ちは嬉しいが何者なんだ」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#DON'T BE LIKE THAT. I KNOW YOU ARE ON A NOBLE QUEST.", "#YELLOW#「そう言うナ。キミが大義のために動いているのは知ってイル」", "chat")
t("I'm busy at the moment, so maybe call back another time?", "「今忙しい。この話はまた後にしないか？」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#I AM YOUR FRIEND. NOW YOU KNOW ME. LET US BEGIN A LONG AND FRUITFUL FRIENDSHIP.", "#YELLOW#「ワタシは味方だ。さあ、これでいいだろウ。末永く、実りある友好関係を築こうではナイカ」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#BUSY, YOU SAY? I CAN FIX THAT, LIKE ANY GOOD FRIEND WOULD.", "#YELLOW#「忙しイ？　ならばワタシが助けてやろウ。莫逆の友とはそういうものダ」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#YOU DON'T BELIEVE ME? THEN PLEASE, ALLOW ME TO SHOW YOU A MERE FRACTION OF MY POWER.", "#YELLOW#「信用できないというのカ？　ではワタシの力をほんの少し披露させてクレ」", "chat")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/avatar-distant-sun.chat"

t("#YELLOW#YOU ARE A CURIOUS ONE.", "#YELLOW#「キミは面白いナ」", "chat")
t("[...]", "「・・・」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#YOU HAVE MADE THE RIGHT CHOICE. TOGETHER, WE SHALL BRING ABOUT THE DESTRUCTION OF OUR ENEMIES.", "#YELLOW#「賢明な選択ダ。共に我らが敵を滅ぼすとしよウ」", "chat")
t("#GOLD#[you are now an Avatar of a Distant Sun]", "#GOLD#（「遥けき太陽」の化身となった）", "chat")
t("Yes, give me your power!", "「わかった、力をくれ！」", "chat")
t([[<<<You feel the gentle warmth of your Distant Sun patron. It speaks directly to your mind!>>>
#YELLOW#I AM HERE. DO YOU DESIRE TO SMITE EVIL, DESTROY THE DARKNESS AND SCOUR THE EARTH? I SHALL AID YOU IN THIS QUEST. TOGETHER, WE WILL BE UNSTOPPABLE. ALL DARKNESS SHALL BE CONSUMED BY OUR LIGHT.
#LAST#]], [[　　（頭の中が仄かに暖かくなる。力を借りている「遥けき太陽」が心に直接語り掛けてきた！）
　#YELLOW#「やあ。悪を倒し、闇を祓って世界を燃やしたくはないカ？　そうなら手を貸そウ。手を取り合えば敵はナイ。暗黒を悉く我らが光で塗りつぶすノダ」#LAST#]], "chat")
t("Who... Who are you?", "「お前は一体何者なんだ？」", "chat")
t("But what are you getting out of this?", "「そちらに何の得がある？」", "chat")
t("That doesn't tell me anything.", "「言っていることがよく解らないな」", "chat")
t("But how are you speaking to me?", "「どうやって話しかけてるんだ？」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#I AM YOUR FRIEND. IT IS GOOD TO HAVE FRIENDS, ISN'T IT?", "#YELLOW#　「ワタシは味方ダ。友ができるのは良いことではないカ？」", "chat")
t("You still haven't told me who or what you are.", "「お前が一体何なのか答えを聞いていないぞ」", "chat")
t([[#YELLOW#YOU NEED NOT CONCERN YOURSELF WITH SUCH THINGS. I KNOW YOU CRAVE POWER. I KNOW THE WEIGHT OF THE WORLD IS ON YOUR SHOULDERS. SO, ACCEPT MY BOONS. ALLOW ME TO HELP YOU.
]], [[#YELLOW#　「そんなことを気にする必要はなイ。強くなりたいだろウ？　世界の運命はお前にかかってイル。ならばワタシを受け入れるがイイ。力になろウ」
]], "chat")
t("#YELLOW#I AM GETTING PLENTY OUT OF THIS.", "#YELLOW#「得ということなら大いにアル」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#I TIRE OF YOUR NAGGING QUESTIONS. TALK, TALK, TALK. YOU HAVE A SIMPLE CHOICE BEFORE YOU. WILL YOU BECOME POWERFUL? OR WILL YOU BE WEAK AND ALONE?", "#YELLOW#　「根掘り葉掘りしつこイ。ああだこうだト。話は簡単ダ。強くなりたいのカ？　それとも手を組まず、弱いままでいるのカ？」", "chat")
t("I don't trust you. Please go away.", "「信用できないな。もう話しかけないでくれ」", "chat")
t("#YELLOW#I HAVE LITTLE PATIENCE FOR TIME WASTERS. THIS SHALL BE THE LAST TIME WE SPEAK.", "#YELLOW#　「わからずやを相手にするほど気長ではないゾ。もうお前の相手はやめダ」", "chat")
t("#GRAY#[prodigy point refunded]", "#GRAY#（奥義ポイントが戻りました）", "chat")

