section "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-orb-scrying.lua"

t("You immerse your mind in the Way and let knowledge flow in.", "「道」と一体となり、情報を受け入れる・・・", "_t")
t("[Images and knowledge flow in.]", "イメージと知識が流れ込んできた。", "_t")
t("[You do not gain any knowledge.]", "特に得るものはなかった。", "_t")
t("You pause and recall past memories.", "じっと過去の記憶を思い出してみた。", "_t")
t("[You do not recognize anything new.]", "特に興味深いものはなかった。", "_t")
t("Oh, hi @playername@, have you got something new to show me?", "　「あらあら、@playername@。何か見つけたの？　見せてみて？」", "_t")
t("Yes, Elisa, could you have a look at these objects please? [show her the items the orb could not identify]", "「ああ、エリサ。これを見てくれないか？」（オーブでは鑑定できなかったアイテムを見せる）", "_t")
t("Err, no... sorry, I just wanted to hear a friendly voice.", "「あー・・・いや。ただ君の声が聞きたくなって」", "_t")
t("Not yet sorry!", "「いや、特に何も！」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*You hear something akin to a muffled giggle*#WHITE#
Oh, you are #{bold}#SOOOO#{normal}# cute!]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　押し殺したような笑い声が聞こえる。*#WHITE#
　「まあああああああああああ！　おませさん！」]], "_t")
t("Goodbye, Elisa!", "「じゃあね！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/elisa-shop.lua"

t([[Let's see what have you got here...
%s

That is very nice, @playername@!]], [[　「さてさて、これは何かしら・・・」
%s
　「凄いわ、@playername@！」]], "tformat")
t("Thank you, Elisa!", "「どうも、エリサ！」", "_t")
t("Hello friend, what can I do for you?", "「こんにちは。何の御用かしら？」", "_t")
t("Could you have a look at these objects, please? [show her your unidentified items]", "　「これを見てもらえませんか？」（未鑑定アイテムを見せる）", "_t")
t("Nothing, goodbye.", "「いえ、別に。失礼」", "_t")
t([[Wait, @playername@, you seem to be quite the adventurer. Maybe we can help one another.
You see, I #{bold}#LOOOVVVEEEE#{normal}# learning new lore and finding old artifacts of power, but I am not exactly an adventurer and I would surely get killed out there.
So take this orb (#LIGHT_GREEN#*she gives you an orb of scrying*#WHITE#). You can use it to talk to me from anywhere in the world! This way you can show me your new shiny findings!
I get to see many interesting things, and you get to know what your items do. We both win! Isn't it sweet?
Oh yes, the orb will also identify mundane items for you, as long as you carry it.]], "　「待って、アナタって結構腕が立つみたいじゃない。これはお互いにとっていい話だわ。ねえ、私、とおおおおおおおおおおおっても言い伝えとかが好きなのよ。大昔のアーティファクトもね。でも冒険者ってわけじゃないし、旅に出たらきっと死んじゃうわ。そこでこのオーブの出番（遠見のオーブを受け取った）これがあればどこにいても話せるの。素敵なものが見つかったらこのオーブで私に見せて！　私は面白いものがたっくさん見れるし、アナタは鑑定ができるわ。二人ともハッピー！　いい話でしょ？　あ、それとこのオーブは持ってるだけで普通のアイテムも鑑定してくれるわよ」", "_t")
t("Woah, thanks, Elisa. This is really nice!", "「へえー。ありがとうエリサ。これは凄いね！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest-start.lua"

t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#[Pretend to help but when it is time you will use a Ziguranth technique to make the portal fizzle. @npcname@ will be sent to Zigur to be 'dealt with' properly.]#WHITE#
Lead on; I will protect you.]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#　（ここは助けるふりをしよう。ジグランスで学んだポータル改変の技術を使う時が来た。@npcname@をジガーに送る。そこできちんとした『処遇』を受けるはずだ）#WHITE#
　「案内してください。援護します」]], "_t")
t("Escort", "エスコート", "_t")
t("Go away; I do not help filthy arcane users!", "「失せろ！　汚らわしい魔法使いなどに手を貸すものか！」", "_t")
t("Lead on; I will protect you.", "　「案内してください。援護します」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#[Pretend to help but when it is time you will use a technique to make the portal fizzle. @npcname@ will be sent to Zigur to be 'dealt with' properly.]#WHITE#
Lead on; I will protect you.]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#　（ここは助けるふりをしよう。ポータル改変の技術を使う時が来た。@npcname@をジガーに送る。そこできちんとした『処遇』を受けるはずだ）#WHITE#
　「案内してください。援護します」]], "_t")
t("Go away; I do not care for the weak.", "「失せろ。弱者に構っている暇はない」", "_t")

