section "mod-tome/data/chats/escort-quest.lua"

t([[At the last moment you invoke the power of nature.  The portal fizzles and transports @npcname@ to Zigur.
You can feel Nature thanking you.]], [[　ようやく大地の力を発揮できた。ポータルは誤作動し、@npcname@はジガーに転移した。大地の恵みを感じる。
]], "_t")
t([[Thank you, my friend. I do not think I would have survived without you.
Please let me reward you:]], "　「ありがとう、友よ。ここまで来れたのはお力添えあってのこと。お礼をさせてください」", "_t")
t("There you go. Farewell!", "「無事で何より。では！」", "_t")
t("Thank you.", "「心強い言葉です」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/fallen-aeryn.lua"

t("%s grabs her amulet and disappears in a whirl of arcane energies.", "%sがアミュレットを握ると魔力が渦を巻き、姿が消えた。", "logPlayer")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*She lies nearly dead at your feet*#WHITE#
So, now you will kill me and complete the cycle of destruction?]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　エアリンが息も絶え絶えに倒れている。*#WHITE#
　「これで私を殺し、殺しの総仕上げというわけか？」]], "_t")
t("What are you talking about? Why did you attack me?", "「何の話だ？　なぜ襲ってきた？」", "_t")
t("Speak and I might spare you. Why did you attack me?", "「冷静に話し合いましょう。どうしてこんなことをしたんです？」", "_t")
t("[kill her]", "止めを刺す", "_t")
t([[You.. you do not know?
A few hours after you entered this place a raid of orcs fell upon us. They were not alone -- demons walked among them. We were overwhelmed! Utterly destroyed!
My land is no more! All because you could not stop them at the Charred Scar! You failed us! People died to protect you, and you failed!
#LIGHT_GREEN#*She starts to weep...*#WHITE#]], [[　「そんな・・・無関係だというのか・・・？　お前が頂に入ってものの数時間。オーク共の大軍が押し寄せてきた。オークだけではない、デーモンも混じっていたよ。多勢に無勢であった！　全滅だ！　もはや帰るべき故郷はない！　それというのも貴様が焦炎の傷痕で奴らを止めなかったからだ！　貴様は皆の期待を裏切った！　皆お前を守るために死んでいったのに！　使命を果たさなかったのだ！」
#LIGHT_GREEN#*　そう言ってエアリンは嗚咽を漏らした。*#WHITE#]], "_t")
t("I know my mistakes and I intend to correct them. Please let me pass. I cannot save your people, but I can make their deaths mean something!", "「自らの過ちは解っています。この手で正したいのです。通してください。お仲間のことは残念ですが、その死を意義あるものとしたいのです！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-main.lua"

t("What may I do for you?", "　「何か御用かな？」", "_t")
t("Lady Aeryn, at last I am back home! [tell her your story]", "「ただいま戻りました！」（いきさつを話す）", "_t")
t("Tell me more about the Gates of Morning.", "「暁の門について詳しく教えてください」", "_t")
t("Before I came here, I happened upon members of the Sunwall in Maj'Eyal. Do you know of this?.", "「西方で太陽の壁の一員を見かけましたが。心当たりは？」", "_t")
t("I need help in my hunt for clues about the staff.", "「杖の在処を追っているのですが助力を願えませんか」", "_t")
t("I have destroyed the leaders of all the Orc Prides.", "「オークの部族長達を全員討伐しました」", "_t")
t("I am back from the Charred Scar, where the orcs took the staff.", "「焦炎の傷痕から戻ってきました。オーク共があそこに杖を持ち込んでいました」", "_t")
t("A dying paladin gave me this map; something about orc breeding pits. [tell her the story]", "「瀕死の騎士からこの地図を。オーク共の産屋のようです」（事情を話す）", "_t")
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "chat_gates-of-morning-main")
t([[@playername@! We thought you had died in the portal explosion. I am glad we were wrong. You saved the Sunwall.
The news about the staff is troubling. Ah well, please at least take time to rest for a while.]], "　「@playername@！　ポータルの爆発に巻き込まれ、帰らぬ人になったと思っていた。思い違いで何よりだ。君のおかげで太陽の壁は難を逃れた。その杖の話は気にかかるな。まあ何はなくとも、ひとまず体を休めてくれ」", "_t")
t("I shall, thank you, my lady.", "「お言葉に甘えさせて頂きます」", "_t")
t([[There are two main groups in the population here, Humans and Elves.
Humans came here in the Age of Pyre. Our ancestors were part of a Mardrop expedition to find what had happened to the Naloren lands that sunk under the sea. Their ship was wrecked and the survivors landed on this continent.
They came across a group of elves, seemingly native to those lands, and befriended them - founding the Sunwall and the Gates of Morning.
Then the orc pride came and we have been fighting for our survival ever since.]], "　「この地に住む民は主に二種類。人間とエルフだ。人間は篝火の時代にここへやってきた。マードロップの探索行に加わった一員が我らの先祖。ナローレの領土が海中に沈んだ原因を調査するのが目的だった。その時船が壊れて、生存者がこの大陸に辿り着いた。そしてエルフ達と出会ったのだ。彼らは元からここに住んでいたようだ。両者は友好関係を築き、太陽の壁と暁の門を設立した。その後オーク共が現れ、以来我々は絶え間なく攻撃を受けている」", "_t")
t("Thank you, my lady.", "「どうも」", "_t")
t("Ahh, so they survived? That is good news...", "　「ああ、ならば生きていたのか？　それはよかった・・・」", "_t")
t("Go on.", "「どういうことです」", "_t")
t("Well, actually...", "「ええ、本当に」", "_t")
t([[The people you saw are likely the volunteers of Zemekkys' early experiments regarding the farportals.
He is a mage who resides here in the Sunwall, eccentric but skilled, who believes that creation of a new farportal to Maj'Eyal is possible.
Aside from a few early attempts with questionable results, he hasn't had much luck. Still, it's gladdening to hear that the volunteers for his experiments live, regardless of their location. We are all still under the same Sun, after all.

Actually... maybe it would benefit you if you meet Zemekkys. He would surely be intrigued by that Orb of Many Ways you possess. He lives in a small house just to the north.]], [[　「西方で見かけたという騎士達は、ゼメッキスが実験を始めたころの志願者だろう。大ポータルに関する研究だ。彼はここ、太陽の壁に居を構える魔法使いで、変人だが腕は確か。マイ・イヤルに通じる大ポータルを新設しようと頑張っている。最初の頃に疑問符が付くような成果を少し上げただけで、あまり上手くいってはいないが。だが異邦の地にいるにしろ、志願者が無事と判って心が晴れた。同じ太陽を戴いていることに変わりはない。
　そうだな・・・ゼメッキスと話をしてみてはどうだろうか。貴殿に利するところがあるかもしれぬ。その分岐のオーブにはきっと興味津々だ。ここからすぐ北にある小さな家に住んでいる」]], "_t")
t("Maybe I'll visit him. Thank you.", "「なるほど。折を見て訪ねてみます」", "_t")
t([[The news has indeed reached me. I could scarce believe it, so long have we been at war with the Pride.
Now they are dead? At the hands of just one @playerdescriptor.race@? Truly I am amazed by your power.
While you were busy bringing an end to the orcs, we managed to discover some parts of the truth from a captive orc.
He talked about the shield protecting the High Peak. It seems to be controlled by "orbs of command" which the masters of the Prides had in their possession.
He also said the only way to enter the peak and de-activate the shield is through the "slime tunnels", located somewhere in one of the Prides, probably Grushnak.
]], [[　「こちらにもその報せは届いている。俄かには信じられなかった。オーク共とは久しく戦ってきたのだ。それが全滅とは！　たった一人の@playerdescriptor.race@の手によって！　貴殿の強さには驚嘆を禁じ得ない。そちらがオーク共の始末に集中している間に、捕虜のオークから貴重な情報を入手した。『遥かなる頂』は結界が張られているという。『支配の宝珠』で制御しているらしく、各プライドの長がそれぞれ持っているそうだ。これも捕虜からの情報だが、頂に入り、結界を解除するには『スライム坑道』を通るしかない。四部族のどこか、多分グルシュナクのプライドにあるはずだ」
]], "_t")
t("Thanks, my lady. I have not been able to find all of the orbs of command in my travels; could you have some of your men search for me?", "「なるほど。まだオーブは集まっていません。人をやって探してもらえませんか？」", "_t")
t("Thanks, my lady. I will look for the tunnel and venture inside the Peak.", "「わかりました。スライム坑道へ行き、頂を目指します」", "_t")
t([[I have already sent parties to clear out the remainder of the prides as you progressed, and have instructed to keep a sharp eye out for any orbs of command you may have missed.
	Which do you not have? I can check with the parties if they found any. Our sources indicate that you should have four: one of Undeath, one of Destruction, one of Dragons, and one of Elemental might.]], "　「貴殿が撃破したプライドの跡を探索するよう、既に部隊を送ってある。『草の根分けて探してくれ。未回収のオーブがあるかもしれない』と。足りないオーブはどれだ？　見つけたかどうか確認してみよう。集めた情報によればオーブは４つあるはずだ。不死のオーブ、破壊のオーブ、竜のオーブ、元素のオーブ」", "_t")
t("The orb of Undeath.", "「不死のオーブがありません」", "_t")
t("The orb of Destruction.", "「破壊のオーブがありません」", "_t")
t("The orb of Dragons.", "「竜のオーブがありません」", "_t")
t("The orb of Elements.", "T「元素のオーブがありません」", "_t")
t("Thanks, my lady, that is all of them. I will look for the tunnel and venture inside the Peak.", "「これで全部揃いました。スライム坑道へ行き、頂を目指します」", "_t")
t("Ah yes, my men have found that in Rak'Shor Pride. Here: ", "　「ああ、それならラク・ショルのプライドで見つかった。これだな」", "_t")
t("Ah yes, my men have found that in Vor Pride. Here: ", "　「ああ、それならヴォーのプライドで見つかった。これだな」", "_t")
t("Ah yes, my men have found that in Grushnak Pride. Here: ", "　「ああ、それならグルシュナクのプライドで見つかった。これだな」", "_t")
t("Ah yes, my men have found that in Gorbat Pride. Here: ", "　「ああ、それならゴーバットのプライドで見つかった。これだな」", "_t")
t([[As much as I would like to help, our forces are already spread too thin; we cannot provide you with direct assistance.
But I might be able to help you by explaining how the Pride is organised.
Recently we have heard the Pride speaking about a new master, or masters. They might be the ones behind that mysterious staff of yours.
We believe that the heart of their power is the High Peak, in the center of the continent. But it is inaccessible and covered by some kind of shield.
You must investigate the bastions of the Pride. Perhaps you will find more information about the High Peak, and any orc you kill is one less that will attack us.
The known bastions of the Pride are:
- Rak'shor Pride, in the west of the southern desert
- Gorbat Pride, in a mountain range in the southern desert
- Vor Pride, in the northeast
- Grushnak Pride, on the eastern slope of the High Peak]], [[　「手を貸したいのはやまやまだが、こちらは既に寡兵。直に支援はできない。だがオーク共の部族、『プライド』がどのようになっているのかは説明しよう。オーク共が奴らの新たな主について話しているのを最近耳にした。あるいは主達、か。その不思議な杖を奪うように画策したのはその者たちかもしれない。奴らの本拠地は大陸の中心に位置する、『遥かなる頂』にあるはず。だが、結界のようなものが張られていて侵入は不可能。貴殿にはオーク共の拠点を調査してもらいたい。頂について新たな発見があるやもしれぬ。それにオークを一匹でも斃してくれればそれだけ脅威が一つ減るというもの。これが各プライドの拠点だ」
　
・ラク・ショル部族　南にある砂漠の西端
・ゴーバット部族　　南にある砂漠の山間
・ヴォー部族　　　　太陽の壁の北東
・グルシュナク部族　北西の山脈]], "_t")
t("I will investigate them.", "「調べてみます」", "_t")
t("Aeryn points to the known locations on your map.", "エアリンが地図にオーク達の拠点を記してくれた。", "logPlayer")
t([[One more bit of aid I might give you before you go. Your tale has moved me, and the very stars shine with approval of your relentless pursuit. Take their blessing, and let nothing stop you in your quest.
	#LIGHT_GREEN#*She touches your forehead with one cool hand, and you feel a surge of power*
	]], [[　「旅立つ前にもう一つ。貴殿の勲には感嘆した。不断の探求を讃えて星々も輝いている。天の力を受けてほしい。その探求を阻むものが無きよう」
	#LIGHT_GREEN#*　ひんやりとしたエアリンの手が額に触れると、力が沸き上がってきた。*
	]], "_t")
t("I'll leave not a single orc standing.", "「オークを皆殺しにしてやりましょう」", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#You have learned the talent Relentless Pursuit.", "#VIOLET#「不断なる探求」を習得した。", "logPlayer")
t("I have heard about that; good men lost their lives for this. I hope it was worth it.", "　「話は聞いている。皆、素晴らしい勇士であった。その死が無駄にならぬように祈ろう」", "_t")
t("Yes, my lady, they delayed the orcs so that I could get to the heart of the volcano. *#LIGHT_GREEN#Tell her what happened#WHITE#*", "「ええ。命を懸けてオーク共の足止めをしてくれました。おかげで火山の中心部に」*#LIGHT_GREEN#（あらましを話す）#WHITE#*", "_t")
t("I am afraid I was too late, but I still have some valuable information. *#LIGHT_GREEN#Tell her what happened#WHITE#*", "「間に合わなかったようです。しかし貴重な情報を入手しました」*#LIGHT_GREEN#（あらましを話す）#WHITE#*", "_t")
t([[Sorcerers? I have never heard of them. There were rumours about a new master of the Pride, but it seems they have two.
Thank you for everything. You must continue your hunt now that you know what to look for.]], "　「ソーサラー？　初耳だ。オーク共が新たな主を戴いたという噂はあったが。どうも二人組のようだな。尽力に感謝する。目星もついたことだ、引き続き調査を続けてほしい」", "_t")
t("I will avenge your men.", "「皆の仇をとってみせます」", "_t")
t([[Sorcerers? I have never heard of them. There were rumours about a new master of the Pride, but it seems they have two.
I am afraid with the power they gained today they will be even harder to stop, but we do not have a choice.]], "　「ソーサラー？　初耳だ。オーク共が新たな主を戴いたという噂はあったが。奴らが今日力を手にしたおかげで、一層強大となったに違いない。だからといって諦めるわけにはいかないが」", "_t")
t("Ah! This is wonderful! Finally a ray of hope amidst the darkness. I will assign my best troops to this. Thank you, @playername@ - take this as a token of gratitude.", "「ああ！　それは素晴らしい！　ついに希望の光が射したか。選りすぐりの者たちを送ろう。これは感謝のしるしだ」", "_t")
t("Good luck.", "「幸運を」", "_t")
t("Aeryn gives you: %s", "エアリンから%sを貰った。", "logPlayer")
-- old translated text
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/gates-of-morning-welcome.lua"

t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a beautiful woman clad in shining golden armour*#WHITE#
Stop! You are clearly a stranger! Where do you come from? The Gates of Morning are the last bastion of freedom in these lands, so who are you? A spy?]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　黄金色に輝く鎧を纏った麗人がいる。*#WHITE#
　「止まれ！　何者だ！　どこから来た？　暁の門はこの地における自由の民の最後の砦。素性の知れぬ者を入れるわけにはいかない。間諜か？」]], "_t")
t("My lady, I am indeed a stranger in these lands. I come from the west, from Maj'Eyal.", "「確かにここでは異邦人です。西方のマイ・イヤルからこの地にやってきました」", "_t")
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "chat_gates-of-morning-welcome")
t([[Maj'Eyal! For many years have we tried to contact your people. We always failed.
In any event, what is your purpose here?]], "　「マイ・イヤル！　長らくそちらと連絡を取ろうとしてきたのだが。全て徒労に終わっていた。それはともかく、貴殿はなぜここへ？」", "_t")
t("It seems that I am stranded in these unfamiliar lands. #LIGHT_GREEN#*Tell her about your hunt for orcs and your encounter with Fillarel.*#WHITE#", "「異邦の地に迷い込んでしまったみたいで」 #LIGHT_GREEN#*（オークとフィラレルに遭ったことを話す）*#WHITE#", "_t")
t("Sun Paladins? What do you mean? We know of no such thing where I come from.", "「太陽の騎士とは一体？　西方では聞いたことがありません」", "_t")
t([[We are the mighty warriors of the Sunwall, channeling the power of the Sun and merging it with martial training.
For hundreds of years, we stood between the Orc Pride and the free people. Our numbers are diminishing, but we will stand firm until our last breath.]], "　「太陽の壁を守る勇士のことだ。陽の力を借り、戦いに活かしている。何百年もの間、オーク共に対する盾となってきた。戦力は減る一方だが、最後の一人が斃れるまで戦い抜く所存」", "_t")
t("You have a noble spirit, my lady.", "「見事なお志」", "_t")
t([[Orcs! Ah! Well then this is your lucky day. This whole continent is swarming with Orcs. They have united as the Orc Pride and, according to rumour, their masters are powerful.
They roam the lands freely, ever assaulting us.
@playername@, you have helped one of ours. I grant you access to the Gates of Morning and name you friend of the Sunwall.]], "　「オークか！　ああ！　ならば良い一日を送れたということ！　オーク共はこの東方に蔓延っている。『プライド』を作って一致団結し、噂によれば強力な主達を戴いているというが。跳梁跋扈し、我々は久しく攻撃を受けている。@playername@殿、よくぞ同志を救ってくれた。暁の門に迎え、太陽の壁の友と認めよう」", "_t")
t("Thank you, my lady.", "「どうも」", "_t")
-- old translated text
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/golbug-explains.lua"

t([[#VIOLET#*As you open the door you notice a huge orc in the distance, covered in both flames and ice.*#LAST#
@playerdescriptor.race@! You should never have come! Your doom awaits!
The Orc Pride will never yield to anybody! They have their precious and there is nothing you can do.]], [[#VIOLET#*　ドアを開けると遠目に巨体のオークが見えた。炎と氷に覆われている。*#LAST#
　「@playerdescriptor.race@めが！　ここを嗅ぎつけてくるとはな！　貴様の死に場所はここだ！　オークは誰にも負けねえ！　あの方々はお気に入りの品をモノにした。何をしようが無駄なこった」]], "_t")
t("The Orc Pride obeys a master? I see... 'pride' indeed!", "「オーク共に主人がいるのか？　・・・なるほど誇り高いことだな！」", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[Attack]", "#LIGHT_GREEN#攻撃する", "_t")
t("The Pride chooses its allies. It has no master! ATTACK!", "　「オークは手を組む相手を選ぶだけだ。主人なぞ持たねえ！　やっちまえ！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/jewelry-store.lua"

t("Imbue which ring?", "どの指輪にしますか？", "_t")
t("Use which gem?", "どの宝石にしますか？", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.", "#CRIMSON#この種の既に決定された事柄はタイムトラベルでは変えられない。", "_t")
t("%s failed to craft with %s and %s!", "%sは%sと%sを使ったアイテム作成に失敗した！", "logPlayer")
t("Not enough money", "お金が足りない", "_t")
t("This costs %d gold, you need more gold.", "これには%dゴールド掛かりますが、お金が足りません。", "tformat")
t("Imbue cost", "代金", "_t")
t("This will cost you %s gold, do you accept?", "%sゴールド掛かりますがよろしいですか？", "tformat")
t("%s %s ring", "%s%s指輪", "tformat")
t("weird", "奇妙な", "_t")
t("%s creates: %s", "%sは%sを作成した。", "logPlayer")
t("Imbue which amulet?", "どのアミュレットにしますか？", "_t")
t("Use which first gem?", "一個目の宝石を選んでください", "_t")
t("Use which second gem?", "二個目の宝石を選んでください", "_t")
t("Limmir needs more gold for the magical plating.", "　リムミールが魔法でメッキするのにもっと金が必要だ。", "_t")
t("You need to use %s gold for the plating, do you accept?", "%sゴールド掛かりますがよろしいですか？", "tformat")
t("Limmir's Amulet of the Moon", "リムミール作・月のアミュレット", "_t")
t("Welcome, @playername@, to my shop.", "「いらっしゃい、@playername@」", "_t")
t("Let me see your wares.", "「商品を見せてくれないか」", "_t")
t("I am looking for special jewelry.", "「特殊な装身具が欲しいんです」", "_t")
t("So you can infuse amulets in this place?", "「ここでアミュレットに宝石を埋め込めると？」", "_t")
t("I have found this tome; it looked important.", "「こんな本を見つけました。貴重な物みたいですが」", "_t")
t("Sorry I have to go!", "「失礼します！」", "_t")
t([[Then you are at the right place, for I am an expert jeweler.
If you bring me a gem and a ring, I can create a new ring imbued with the properties of the gem.  The original traits of the ring will be lost in the process but new ones of similar quality will be generated.
There is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring, and you need a quality ring to use a quality gem.]], "　「当店にようこそ。私はアクセサリの専門家ですからね。宝石と指輪を持ってきてくれれば、嵌めてあげますよ。指輪に備わった能力は消失してしまいますが、元と同じくらいの強さで新たな能力が宿ります。指輪の等級に応じて少し費用がかかります。使う指輪は宝石の等級と同じものが必要です」", "_t")
t("I need your services.", "「やってください」", "_t")
t("Not now, thanks.", "「やはり今はいいです」", "_t")
t([[Yes! Thanks to you this place is now free from the corruption. I will stay on this island to study the magical aura, and as promised I can make you powerful amulets.
Bring me a an amulet and two different gems and I will turn them into a powerful amulet, though the original properties of the amulet will be lost.
I will not make you pay a fee for it since you helped me so much, but I am afraid the ritual requires a gold plating. This should be equal to about 1000 gold pieces.]], "　「ええ！　おかげさまでこの地を浄化できました。私はここに留まって、この魔法のオーラを研究しようと思います。約束通り、強力なアミュレットも作って差し上げますよ。アミュレットと、異なる種類の宝石を２つ持ってきてください。それで強力なアミュレットが作れます。アミュレットに備わった元の力は消失してしまいますが。御助力頂いたのですからお代は結構。しかしこの作業で金メッキをしなくてはいけません。それで１０００ゴールド分掛かってしまいますね」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*He quickly looks at the tome and looks amazed.*#WHITE# This is an amazing find! Truly amazing!
With this knowledge I could create potent amulets. However, it requires a special place of power to craft such items.
There are rumours about a site of power in the southern mountains. Old legends tell about a place where a part of the Wintertide Moon melted when it got too close to the Sun and fell from the sky.
A lake formed in the crater of the crash. The water of this lake, soaked in intense Moonlight for eons, should be sufficient to forge powerful artifacts!
Go to the lake and then summon me with this scroll. I will retire to study the tome, awaiting your summon.]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　本を流し読みしてリムミールは目を丸くした。*#WHITE# 
　「素晴らしい！　全く素晴らしい！　この技を使えば凄いアミュレットが作れるかもしれない。けれどこの手のアイテムを作るには、特殊なパワースポットで作業しなければ。南方の山にそういう場所があるという噂です。冬輝の月が太陽に近づきすぎた際、その一部が融けて空から滴った場所だという古い伝承が。その時できたクレーターに湖ができたのです。そこの水は太古の昔より強い月光を浴びており、強力なアーティファクトを鍛えるのにふさわしい！　当地へ赴き、このスクロールで私を呼び出してください。店じまいしてこの書を読み、その時を待ちます」]], "_t")
t("I will see if I can find it.", "「その場所に行ってみましょう", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-berethh-encounter.lua"

t([[#VIOLET#*Before you stands Berethh. His face shows no emotion, but his posture is threatening.#LAST#
]], [[#VIOLET#*　ベレスがそこにいた。無表情だが殺気を感じる。#LAST#
]], "_t")
t("Kyless is dead.", "「キレスは死んだよ」", "_t")
t("I'm not sure if you deserved your fate. Still I cannot let you live.", "　「お前が責めを負うべきかどうかはわからない。だが見逃すわけにはいかん」", "_t")
t("Then you will die like Kyless. #LIGHT_GREEN#[Attack]#LAST#", "「ならキレスと同じ目に遭うんだな」#LIGHT_GREEN#（攻撃する）#LAST#", "_t")
t("I need your help. I want to overcome my curse.", "「手を貸してほしい。この呪いを解きたいんだ」", "_t")
t("I do not want to kill you.", "「お前を殺したくはない」", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#*Berethh ignores your comment, unslings his bow and prepares his attack.*#LAST#", "#VIOLET#*　ベレスはその言葉を無視すると、弓を外して攻撃態勢に入った。*#LAST#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[Attack]", "#LIGHT_GREEN#攻撃する", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-caravan-destroyed.lua"

t([[#VIOLET#*As the last member of the caravan lies dying, you look at him and see the hate that fills his eyes.*#LAST#
We should have finished you off that day. You deserved no mercy!]], [[#VIOLET#*　キャラバン最後の一人が虫の息で地面に倒れる。その両目には怒りが漲っていた。*#LAST#
　「あの時殺しておけば。情けをかける価値のないクズめ！」]], "_t")
t("And I will show you no mercy. #LIGHT_GREEN#[Kill him]#LAST#", "「お前もな」#LIGHT_GREEN#（止めを刺す）#LAST#", "_t")
t("I am sorry. #LIGHT_GREEN#[Help him]#LAST#", "「済まない」#LIGHT_GREEN#（手当てをする）#LAST#", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#*Before you can help him, he collapses to the ground and dies.*#LAST#", "#VIOLET#*　手当てをしようとしたが男は倒れ、息を引き取った。*#LAST#", "_t")
t("...", "・・・", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/keepsake-kyless-death.lua"

t([[#VIOLET#*Kyless lies dying on the floor. In his hand he holds a book.*#LAST#
Please! Before I die I have one request. Destroy the book. It wasn't me. The book brought this on us. It must be destoyed!]], [[#VIOLET#*　瀕死のキレスが倒れる。彼はその手に本を握っていた。*#LAST#
　「待て！　最後の頼みだ。この本を処分してくれ。俺のせいじゃない。こいつに操られてたんだ。この世にあっちゃいけない代物だ！」]], "_t")
t("I will. #LIGHT_GREEN#[destroy the book]#LAST#", "「わかった」#LIGHT_GREEN#（本を破壊する）#LAST#", "_t")
t("I'm sorry but I need it. #LIGHT_GREEN#[keep the book]#LAST#", "「悪いがこいつが欲しかったんだ」#LIGHT_GREEN#（本を奪う）#LAST#", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#*You destroy the book. When you finish you look up and see that Kyless is already dead.*#LAST#", "#VIOLET#*　本を破壊した。キレスに目を戻すと、彼は既に事切れていた。*#LAST#", "_t")
t("Goodbye, Kyless.", "「さらばだ、キレス」", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#*You place the book in your pack. When you finish you look up and see that Kyless is already dead.*#LAST#", "#VIOLET#*　本を道具袋に仕舞い込む。キレスに目を戻すと、彼は既に事切れていた。*#LAST#", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/last-hope-elder.lua"

t("Welcome, @playername@, to Last Hope. Traveler, please be quick as my time is precious.", "　「都へようこそ、@playername@。旅人よ、要件があるならば手短に頼む。ワシは忙しいのでな」", "_t")
t("I have found a strange staff in my travels (#LIGHT_GREEN#*describe it in detail*#LAST#)  It looked very old and very powerful. I dared not use it.", "「旅の途中で杖を手に入れたのです（#LIGHT_GREEN#*詳しい特徴を話す*#LAST#）太古の遺物で強大な力を秘めているようでした。とても使ってみる気には」", "_t")
t("The hunt for the staff took me to a continent far to the east, accessible only by magic portal. I've recently returned by just such a portal, and I come bearing instructions on how to construct a similar portal here in Last Hope to make the return journey possible. I'm sure the Elves there would welcome trade with the west.", "「杖を追って遥か東方の大陸に行きつきました。魔法のポータルを使わなければ辿り着けない場所です。まさに同種のポータルでこちらへ戻ってきた次第。同じようなものをこの都に作る手引きを持っています。向こうへ渡るポータルをここに作りたいのです。東方のエルフ達もきっとこちらとの交易を歓迎するでしょう」", "_t")
t("Nothing, excuse me. Bye!", "「特に用はありません。失礼！」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*He remains silent for a while*#WHITE# Indeed you were right to come here.
The staff you describe reminds me of an artifact of great power from ancient times. May I see it?]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　賢人がしばし黙り込む。*#WHITE#
　「ここに来たのはいい判断じゃった。お主の言う杖は太古の大いなるアーティファクトを彷彿とさせる。見ても構わぬか？」]], "_t")
t("Here it is. #LIGHT_GREEN#*Tell him about the encounter with the orcs*#LAST# You should keep it. I can feel its power and it would be safer if it were guarded by the armies of the kingdom.", "「どうぞ#LIGHT_GREEN#*（オークとの遭遇について話す）*#LAST#これを預かっていただけませんか。この杖からは力を感じます。王国軍に保管してもらった方が安心です」", "_t")
t("I am afraid I lost it. #LIGHT_GREEN#*Tell him about the encounter with the orcs*", "「それが奪われてしまったようで#LIGHT_GREEN#*（オークとの遭遇について話す）*", "_t")
t("I had it briefly but have lost it somehow.  It could have been some orcs I encountered ...", "「一度は手にしたのですが無くしてしまいました。オークの一団が奪い去ったと思うのですが・・・」", "_t")
t([[I am truly astonished by your strength; surviving that encounter was an epic feat.
As for the orcs, it is deeply troubling.  We have not seen any for eighty years... could they have come from the far east?
Anyway, thank you again, @playername@, for your help.]], "　「なんとも素晴らしい腕前じゃな。そのような戦いに打ち勝つとは、偉業という他にない。オークのことは非常に気がかりじゃ。ここ八十年は姿を見ていなかったが・・・東方から来たのであろうか？とにかく改めて礼を言うぞ、@playername@殿。御助力に感謝する」", "_t")
t("Thank you, my lord.", "「ありがたいお言葉です」", "_t")
t([[Orcs?! In the west?! This is deeply alarming! We have not seen any for nearly eighty years. They must have come from the far east...
But do not let me trouble you; you brought important news and you are lucky to be alive.]], "　「オーク！？　この西方世界にか！？　大変なことになった！　ここ八十年は姿を見ていなかったのだが。東方から来たに相違あるまい・・・いや、こんなことを言ってお主を煩わせてはいかんな。貴重な報せを運んでくれた。生きて戻ってきたのは幸いじゃわい」", "_t")
t([[We have heard rumours from the Dwarves that there may still be an orc presence deep in the old kingdom of Reknor, in the Iron Throne.
I know you have been through a lot, but we need somebody to investigate and determine if there is a connection with the staff.]], "　「ドワーフ達が噂しているところによると、鉄の王座にある古代王国レクノールの地下にまだオークがいるやもしれぬ。疲れているところ済まぬが、調査に赴いてはくれぬか。その杖と関係があるかどうか確かめてほしいのだ」", "_t")
t("I will check the mines.", "「やりましょう」", "_t")
t("That's extraordinary! I know a number of merchant princes who will salivate at the idea of new trade routes opening. But tell me, how fares your quest for the staff?", "　「なんと！　大商人達にとって新たな交易ルートは垂涎の的となるじゃろう。だがその前に、あの杖の行方はどうなっておる？」", "_t")
t("The staff is recovered and the culprits slain. They will trouble us no more. [tell him the whole story]", "「杖は取り戻し、黒幕達は滅びました。もう何の心配もありません」（一部始終を話す）", "_t")
t("The hunt continues. The construction of this portal will be of great assistance in the staff's recovery.", "「探索は続行中です。都にポータルを作れば、この仕事も大いに捗ります」", "_t")
t("Excellent! Well then, concerning this fascinating portal, I'm afraid that men have largely forgotten whatever they once knew about the great magics of old. I know of only one man in these lands who might be able to help you, a wise man and recent arrival to Last Hope named Tannen. He claims to hail from Angolwen, a supposed haven for practitioners of magic and mysticism. He arrived just months ago with fabulous wealth and has already constructed his own tower in the northern part of the city. I know little of him, but if he is to be believed, then he is your best hope.", "　「それは結構！　ふむ。ポータルを作るというのは素晴らしいが、太古の魔法に関してはどのようなものであれ、大部分が失伝してしまっているはず。このあたりで頼りになりそうな者は一人しか知らぬ。最近ここに越してきたタンネンという賢者じゃ。アンゴルウェンより来たと言うておる。魔術の徒が隠れ住むとされる場所よ。彼はつい数か月前、途轍もない大金を抱えて都に移り、北に塔を建ててしまった。人となりはよく知らぬ。じゃが信用に足る人物であるなら、この男を頼るしかあるまい」", "_t")
t("Thank you.", "「心強い言葉です」", "_t")
t("In that case, let us proceed as quickly as possible. Now, concerning this fascinating portal. I'm afraid that men have largely forgotten whatever they once knew about the great magics of old. I know of only one man in these lands who might be able to help you, a wise man and recent arrival to Last Hope named Tannen. He claims to hail from Angolwen, a supposed haven for practitioners of magic and mysticism. He arrived just months ago with fabulous wealth and has already constructed his own tower in the northern part of the city. I know little of him, but if he is to be believed, then he is your best hope.", "　「それならできるだけ急がねばな。ふむ。ポータルを作るというのは素晴らしいが、太古の魔法に関してはどのようなものであれ、大部分が失伝してしまっているはず。このあたりで頼りになりそうな者は一人しか知らぬ。最近ここに越してきたタンネンという賢者じゃ。アンゴルウェンより来たと言うておる。魔術の徒が隠れ住むとされる場所よ。彼はつい数か月前、途轍もない大金を抱えて都に移り、北に塔を建ててしまった。人となりはよく知らぬ。じゃが信用に足る人物であるなら、この男を頼るしかあるまい」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/last-hope-lost-merchant.lua"

t("Urthol's Wondrous Emporium", "アーソルの天下一品小売店", "_t")
t([[Ah, my #{italic}#good#{normal}# friend @playername@!
Thanks to you I made it safely to this great city! I am planning to open my most excellent boutique soon, but since I am in your debt, perhaps I could open early for you if you are in need of rare goods.]], "　「おお、我が心の友、@playername@！　君のお陰で無事この都に帰ってこれたよ！　近々、最高の専門店を開こうと思ってるんだ。だが君には借りがある。開店前だが特別に珍しい品を見せてあげよう」", "_t")
t("\
By the way, ", "\
　「ところで, ", "_t")
t("during our escape I found the plans for an #YELLOW#Ambush Trap#LAST#", "脱出の際に#YELLOW#伏兵の罠#LAST#の設計図を見つけたんだ。", "_t")
t(" and while", "それと", "_t")
t("while", "", "_t")
t(" organizing my inventory, I came across some #YELLOW#Smelly Toxin#LAST# that a colleague claimed could actually turn creatures to stone.  Truly exotic!", "在庫を整理していたらなんだか#YELLOW#臭いの気になる毒物#LAST#を見つけてね。知り合いが言うには生き物を石に変えてしまうかもしれない。恐ろしい話だねえ！　", "_t")
t(".", "・・・", "_t")
t("\
You would not happen to be interested, by any chance?", "\
こういったものには興味は無かったりするのかな？」", "_t")
t("\
Oh my friend, good news! As I told you I can now request a truly #{italic}#unique#{normal}# object to be crafted just for you. For a truly unique price...", "\
　「やあ、いい報せがある！　前から言っていた通り、実に#{italic}#ユニーク#{normal}#な品を注文できるようになった。君だけの特注さ。値段の方もユニークだがね・・・」", "_t")
t("\
I eventually plan to arrange a truly unique service for the most discerning of customers. If you come back later when I'm fully set up I shall be able to order for you something quite marvellous. For a perfectly #{italic}#suitable#{normal}# price, of course.", "\
　「お得意様用に、他じゃ真似できないサービスをいずれ提供する予定なんだ。準備が整った頃にまた来てくれ。君のために素晴らしい商品を注文できるようになっているはずだ。もちろん値段の方もそれに#{italic}#見合う#{normal}#ものになるがねえ」", "_t")
t("Yes please, let me see your wares.", "「では商品を見せてください」", "_t")
t("What about the unique object?", "「ユニークな商品？」", "_t")
t("Ambush Trap?  Sounds useful.", "「伏兵の罠？　使えそうですね」", "_t")
t("Smelly Toxin?  What kind of smell?", "「毒物？　どんな臭いなんです？」", "_t")
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "chat_last-hope-lost-merchant")
t([[You know, I have asked here and there and it happens to be a very rare thing this contraption...
But since you have saved me, I'm willing to part from it for only 3000 gold pieces, a real bargain!]], "　「ふむ、色々と聞いて回ったんだがこの装置は実に貴重な物らしいね・・・だが君は命の恩人だ。出血大サービスの３０００ゴールドで手放すとしよう！」", "_t")
t("Expensive, but I will take it.", "「値は張りますが頂きましょう」", "_t")
t("...", "・・・", "_t")
t("Nice doing business with you my friend. There you go!", "　「商談成立だな。さあどうぞ！」", "_t")
t("Thanks.", "「ありがたい」", "chat_last-hope-lost-merchant")
t([[Ungrol told me this substance contains some exceedingly rare components.
"More Toxin than Medicine" he said.  Allas, he had not the funds to buy it.  On the other hand, because of our special relationship, I'm willing to let you have it #{italic}#at cost#{normal}# -- only 1500 gold pieces!]], "　「ウングロールによると、極めて珍しい成分を含んでいるそうだ。『薬というよりは毒だなこりゃ』とね。悲しいかな、彼にはこれを買うだけの予算が無くてね。しかし君には恩義がある。代金を払ってくれれば譲ろうじゃないか。たったの１５００ゴールドで！」", "_t")
t("Fairly pricey, but seems useful.  We have a deal!", "「値が張りますね。でも使えそうです。頂きましょう！」", "_t")
t("That price ... er stuff really stinks ...", "「せんごひゃ・・・あー、ちょっと臭いがキツイかな・・・」", "_t")
t("Here you are.  Just be sure not to get any on yourself!", "「さあどうぞ。直接触ってはいけないよ！」", "_t")
t("I normally offer this service only for a truly deserved price, but for you my friend I am willing to offer a 20% discount - #{italic}#only#{normal}# 4000 gold to make an utterly unique item of your choice.  What do you say?", "　「本当なら正当なお代を頂くところなんだが、君とは知らぬ仲じゃなし。２割引きにしようと思う。#{italic}#たったの#{normal}#４０００ゴールドで二つとないお好みの品を作ってあげよう。どうするかね？」", "_t")
t("Why, 'tis a paltry sum - take my order, man, and be quick about it!", "「ええ、安いものです。早く発注を！」", "_t")
t("Yes, please!", "「お願いします！」", "_t")
t("HOW MUCH?! Please, excuse me, I- I need some fresh air...", "「幾らですって？　ちょ、ちょっと失礼。い、息が・・・」", "_t")
t("Not now, thank you.", "「今はいいです」", "_t")
t("dragonbone wand", "竜骨のワンド", "_t")
t("dragonbone totem", "竜骨のトーテム", "_t")
t("voratun torque", "ヴォラタントルク", "_t")
t("I've changed my mind.", "「気が変わりました」", "_t")
t("Which kind of item would you like ?", "　「どのアイテムにするんだね？」", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.", "#CRIMSON#この種の既に決定された事柄はタイムトラベルでは変えられない。", "_t")
t([[Do you want to name your item?
%s]], [[　「アイテムに名前をつけるかね？」
%s]], "tformat")
t("Yes, please.", "「ええ」", "_t")
t("Name your item", "アイテムに命名", "_t")
t("Name", "名前", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#The merchant carefully hands you: %s", "#LIGHT_BLUE#商人は丁重にアイテムを渡してきた：%s", "log")
t("No thanks.", "「やめておくよ」", "_t")
t("Oh I am sorry, it seems we could not make the item your require.", "　「おっと済まない。注文したアイテムを作れなかったようだ」", "_t")
t("Oh, let's try something else then.", "　「では別のものを」", "_t")
t("Oh well, maybe later then.", "　「とりあえずやめておきます」", "_t")
t("*This store does not appear to be open yet*", "この店はまだ開店準備中のようだ。", "_t")
t("[leave]", "放っておく", "_t")
-- old translated text
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "_t")
t("Thanks.", "「ありがたい」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/last-hope-melinda-father.lua"

t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*A man talks to you from inside, the door half open. His voice is sad.*#WHITE#
Sorry, the store is closed.]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　中から男が応えた。ドアは半開きになっている。男の声は打ちひしがれている。*#WHITE#
　「申し訳ない・・・閉店中です・・・」]], "_t")
t("[leave]", "放っておく", "_t")
t("@playername@! My daughter's savior!", "　「@playername@さん！　貴方は娘の恩人です！」", "_t")
t("Hi, I was just checking in to see if Melinda is all right.", "「どうも。メリンダの具合が気になったもので」", "_t")
t("Hi, I would like to talk to Melinda please.", "「どうも。メリンダと話せますか？」", "_t")
t("Melinda", "メリンダ", "_t")
t("Sorry, I have to go!", "「これで失礼します！」", "chat_last-hope-melinda-father")
t("Please take this. It is nothing compared to the life of my child. Oh, and she wanted to thank you in person; I will call her.", "　「これはせめてものお礼です。娘の命に比べたらつまらないものですが。おお、メリンダが是非お礼を申し上げたいと。呼んできましょう」", "_t")
t("Thank you.", "「心強い言葉です」", "_t")
t("Melinda's father gives you: %s", "メリンダの父から%sを受け取った。", "logPlayer")
t("#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.", "#CRIMSON#この種の既に決定された事柄はタイムトラベルでは変えられない。", "_t")
t("@playername@! #LIGHT_GREEN#*She jumps for joy and hugs you while her father returns to his shop.*#WHITE#", "　「@playername@！」　#LIGHT_GREEN#*　メリンダが嬉しそうに懐に飛び込んできた。父親は店番に戻っている。*#WHITE#", "_t")
t("I am glad to see you are fine. It seems your scars are healing quite well.", "「元気そうでよかった。怪我も順調に治ってるみたいだね」", "_t")
t("I am glad to see you well. Take care.", "「会えてよかった。それじゃ」", "_t")
t([[Yes it has mostly healed, though I still do have nightmares. I feel like something is still lurking.
Ah well, the bad dreams are still better than the fate you saved me from!]], "　「うん、もうほとんど大丈夫。でも夜うなされるわ。まだどこか変なのかも。まっ、アナタが助けてくれなかったら生贄になってたんだし悪い夢をみるくらいどうってことないかな」", "_t")
t("Should I come across a way to help you during my travels, I will try to help.", "「冒険の途中で治療の手がかりが見つかったら、手を尽くしてみるよ」", "_t")
t("Thank you, you are most welcome.", "「アリガト。いつでも歓迎よ」", "_t")
t("Most certainly, so what are your plans now?", "「全くその通り。ところで何かやりたいことはあるの？」", "_t")
t("Hi @playername@! I am feeling better now, even starting to grow restless...", "　「@playername@！　体の調子、良くなったみたい。じっとしてるのが辛いくらいよ・・・」", "_t")
t("So what are your plans now?", "「ところで何かやりたいことはあるの？」", "_t")
t("About that, I was thinking that maybe you'd like to go out with me sometime ...", "「それなら、一緒にどこかへ出かけてみたいと思ってたんだけど・・・」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*Melinda appears at the door and kisses you*#WHITE#
Hi my dear, I'm so happy to see you!]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　メリンダがドアを開け、キスをした。*#WHITE#
　「よくぞ来たー！」]], "_t")
t("I am still looking out for an explanation of what happened at the beach.", "「ビーチでの出来事はまだ調査中なんだ」", "_t")
t("About what happened on the beach, I think I have found something.", "「ビーチでの一件について何か分かったかもしれない」", "_t")
t([[I do not know yet, my father won't let me out until I'm fully healed. I've always wanted to do so many things.
That is why I got stuck in that crypt, I want to see the world.
My father gave me some funds so that I can take my future into my own hands. I have some friends in Derth, maybe I will open my own little shop there. ]], "　「まだ決めてないわ。パパは全快するまで何もしちゃダメだって。やりたいことはたくさんあるんだけど。世間を見て回りたくて、それであいつらに捕まっちゃったのよね。独り立ちできるようにパパから元手は貰ってるけど。ダースに友達がいるから、そこで小さなお店でも開こうかな」", "_t")
t("I have seen how you fought those corruptors, the way you destroyed their magic. I want to learn to do the same, so that such horrors never happen again. To anyone.", "　「そういえば悪い魔法使い達とやりあって、魔法を破っていたじゃない？　わたしもあの技を覚えたい。そうすればもう怖い目に遭うこともないでしょ。これ以上犠牲者を出したくないし」", "_t")
t([[Or maybe, well I suppose I can trust you with this, I've always secretly dreamed of learning magic. Real magic I mean not alchemist tricks!
I've learnt about a secret place, Angolwen, where I could learn it.]], "　「それに、ええっと、これはアナタだから打ち明けるんだけど、本当はずっと魔法を覚えたいって思ってたの。本物の魔法よ。錬金術じゃなくて！　アンゴルウェンっていう隠れ里があるらしいけど、そこに行けば魔法を習えるんじゃないかって」", "_t")
t("Derth has its up and downs but I think they could do with a smart girl yes.", "「ダースに行っても良いことばかりじゃないよ。でも利発な君なら大歓迎だろうね」", "_t")
t("Thanks!", "「ふふん！」", "_t")
t("You wish to join our noble crusade against magic? Wonderful! I will talk to them for you.", "「魔法との聖戦に加わりたいのかい？　喜んで！　話を通しておくよ」", "_t")
t("That would be very nice!", "「素敵！」", "_t")
t("I happen to be welcome among the people of Angolwen, I could say a word for you.", "「実はアンゴルウェンには伝手があるんだ。君を紹介できるかも」", "_t")
t("What?!? Just because you rescued me from a moderately-to-extremely gruesome death, you think that entitles you to take liberties?!", "　「えっ？　そりゃあアナタに助けて貰わなかったらどうあがいても酷い死に方をしてたけど。だからってわたしを連れ出すなんてどういうつもり！？」", "_t")
t("WHY AREN'T WOMEN ATTRACTED TO ME I'M A NICE %s.", "「なんだってどいつもこいつもこの魅力を理解しな・・・」%s", "tformat")
t("GIRL", "", "_t")
t("GUY", "", "_t")
t("Uhh, sorry I hear my father calling, see you.", "「あー、ごめんなさい、パパが呼んでるわ。それじゃ」", "_t")
t("Just a minute, I was just...", "「ちょっと待って、ただ・・・」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*She looks at you cheerfully.*#WHITE#
Just kidding. I would love that!]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　メリンダの眼が悪戯っぽく輝いた。*#WHITE#
　「ウソウソ！　行きましょ！」]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[walk away with her]#WHITE#What about a little trip to the south, from the coastline we can see the Charred Scar Volcano, it is a wonderous sight.", "#LIGHT_GREEN#（メリンダと連れ立って歩いていく）#WHITE#「南の方に足を延ばしてみるのはどうかな。海岸線から焦炎の傷痕にある火山が見えるんだ。絶景だよ」", "_t")
t("Joke's on you really, goodbye!", "「ただの冗談だよ。じゃあね！」", "_t")
t("But... ok goodbye.", "「えっ・・・そう。さよなら」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*Melinda looks worried*#WHITE#
Please tell me you can help!]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　メリンダは不安そうだ。*#WHITE#
　「それって治せるんでしょ！？」]], "_t")
t("Yes, I think so. Some time ago I assumed ownership of a very special home... #LIGHT_GREEN#[tell her the Fortress story]#WHITE#", "「多分。以前、二つとない拠点を手に入れて・・・」#LIGHT_GREEN#（シェール・タルの城塞について話す）#WHITE#", "_t")
t([[An ancient fortress of a mythical race?! How #{bold}#exciting#{normal}#!
And you say it could cure me?]], "　「古代種族の城砦！　#{bold}#凄い！#{normal}#　そこに行けば治るのね？」", "_t")
t("The Fortress seems to think so. I know this might sound a bit .. inappropriate .. but you would need to come live there, at least for a while.", "「城塞の執事はそう言ってる。こういうことを言うのはちょっと・・・気が引けるんだけど・・・そこに寝泊まりなきゃいけないんだ。当分の間はね」", "_t")
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*She looks at you cheerfully*#WHITE#
Ah the plan to sleep with me is finally revealed!
Shhh you dummy, I thought we were past such silliness, I will come, both for my health and because I want to be with you.
#LIGHT_GREEN#*She kisses you tenderly*#WHITE#]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　メリンダは目をキラキラさせている。*#WHITE#
　「あー、一つ屋根の下計画がついに発動したのね！　もうっ、そういう遠慮をするラインはとっくに超えてると思ってたけど？　行くわ。治療もするし、一緒にいたいしね」
#LIGHT_GREEN#*　チュッ。*#WHITE#]], "_t")
t("Then my lady, if you will follow me. #LIGHT_GREEN#[take her to the Fortress]", "「ではお嬢様、ご案内いたします」#LIGHT_GREEN#（メリンダを城塞に連れていく）", "_t")
-- untranslated text
--[==[
t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*You take Melinda in your arms and press her against you. The warmth of the contact lightens your heart.*#WHITE#
I feel safe in your arms. Please, I know you must leave, but promise to come back soon and hold me again.]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*You take Melinda in your arms and press her against you. The warmth of the contact lightens your heart.*#WHITE#
I feel safe in your arms. Please, I know you must leave, but promise to come back soon and hold me again.]], "_t")
t("I think I would enjoy that very much. #LIGHT_GREEN#[kiss her]#WHITE#", "I think I would enjoy that very much. #LIGHT_GREEN#[kiss her]#WHITE#", "_t")
t("That thought will carry me in the dark places I shall walk. #LIGHT_GREEN#[kiss her]#WHITE#", "That thought will carry me in the dark places I shall walk. #LIGHT_GREEN#[kiss her]#WHITE#", "_t")
t("Oh, I am sorry. I think you are mistaken. I was only trying to comfort you.", "Oh, I am sorry. I think you are mistaken. I was only trying to comfort you.", "_t")
t("Oh, sorry, I was not myself. Goodbye, then. Farewell.", "Oh, sorry, I was not myself. Goodbye, then. Farewell.", "_t")
--]==]

