section "mod-tome/data/chats/melinda-beach-end.lua"

t("What just happened?!", "　「何があったの！？」", "_t")
t("I'm sorry I didn't manage to protect you and as you were about to die you... fired a powerful wave of blight.", "「済まない。君を守ってあげられなかった。間一髪のところで・・・君が凄まじい腐敗の力を解き放ったんだ」", "_t")
t("But I have never cast a spell in my life!", "　「でも魔法なんて全然使えないのに！」", "_t")
t("You are still tainted by that ... foul Demon! The taint is not all gone!", "「まだあの・・・忌まわしいデーモンの力が残っているんだ！　完全には浄化できてない！」", "_t")
t("There must be some of that demon's taint still inside you.", "「まだあのデーモンの力が君の中に残っているんだろう」", "_t")
t("This is terrible! I assure you I had no idea this would happen. You must trust me!", "　「そんな！　こんなことになるなんて全然知らなかった！　本当よ！」", "_t")
t("I do. The Ziguranth are not raving zealots, you know. We will look for a way to cure you, as long as you reject the blight.", "「落ち着いて。ほら、ジグランスだって魔法に関わった者を手当り次第に殺し回ってるわけじゃない。一緒に治療法を探そう。邪悪な力に屈してはいけない」", "_t")
t("This is terrible! What is happening to me?!? You must help me!", "　「そんな！　いったいなんだっていうの？　ねえ、お願い、助けて！」", "_t")
t("I will. We will find a cure for this together.", "「ああ。一緒に治療法を探そう」", "_t")
t("I'm a very lucky girl, am I not... This is the second time I've had you to save me now.", "　「私ったら最高に幸せ者なんじゃないかしら・・・これで二回も助けてもらったことになるのね」", "_t")
t("Over the last weeks you've become very important to me, and I am glad to have you. This is certainly not the place to talk, though, let's go.", "「この数週間で君はもうかけがえのない人になってしまったよ。君と出会えて本当に良かった。でもここじゃゆっくり話もできない。行こう」", "_t")
t("You're right, let's get out of here.", "　「そうね。行きましょ」", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[go back to Last Hope]", "#LIGHT_GREEN#都に戻る", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/melinda-beach.lua"

t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*The two of you spend some time relaxing on the beach.
The air is fresh, the sand shimmers, and the surf roars softly.*#WHITE#

This was such a lovely idea!
I have had a wonderful time with you today.

#LIGHT_GREEN#*She looks longingly into your eyes.*#WHITE#]], [[　メリンダと浜辺でくつろぐ。空気は澄み渡り、砂浜は日差しを受けて煌めいている。寄せては返す波の音が穏やかに響いていた。
　
　「ここに来たのは大正解だったわ！　貴方と素敵な一日を過ごしているんだもの」

#LIGHT_GREEN#*　メリンダが切なげに顔を寄せてくる。*#WHITE#]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[Lean closer and kiss her]#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#顔を近づけ、唇を重ねる#WHITE#", "_t")
t([[Just before your lips touch, you sense that something is very wrong.
]], [[　唇が合わさる寸前、強い違和感を覚えた。
]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#[Continue...]#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#・・・#WHITE#", "_t")

