section "mod-tome/data/chats/ring-of-blood-master.lua"

t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a small humanoid creature with a disproportionate head.*#WHITE#
Ah, what have we here? @playerdescriptor.race@, I believe you have turned at the wrong corner.]], [[#LIGHT_GREEN#*　小柄な人型種族がいる。頭が不釣り合いに大きい。*#WHITE#
　「うん、どういうつもりだ？　@playerdescriptor.race@よ、お前の持ち場はここじゃない」]], "_t")
t("So it would seem. What is going on here?", "「そうみたいだな。ここで何をやってるんだ？」", "_t")
t([[This is my Ring of Blood! Listen, you have now two choices.
Since you do not look like slave fodder to me I will offer to let you pay to play the game.
If you feel you cannot take part in a slaver's game, I am afraid you will need to... disappear.]], "　「ここは我が血闘場！　いいか、お前には二つの道がある。一山いくらの奴隷ではあるまいし、金を払えば楽しいひと時を過ごさせてやろう。奴隷を使って遊ぶのが気に入らないと言うのなら・・・出ていった方がいいな」", "_t")
t("Slavers? This is so wrong! [attack]", "「貴様奴隷商か？　許せない！」（攻撃する）", "_t")
t("You think so? Die.", "ほう、そうか？　死ね。", "_t")
t("Game? I like playing, what's this about?", "「楽しいひと時？　何をするんだ？」", "_t")
t([[Well, you see, it's quite simple. I will mentally take control of various wild creatures or slaves while you use the orb of command on the other side of this room to take control of a slave.
Then we fight using our pawns for 10 rounds. If your slave survives you will win the Bloodcaller.]], "　「ああ、まあ簡単な話さ。俺は精神力で色んな動物や奴隷を操る。そっちは部屋の向かいにある操作オーブで奴隷を動かすんだ。手下を使って１０ラウンド戦う。お前の奴隷が生き残れば『血闘』に勝利という具合だ」", "_t")
t("What if I lose?", "「それで負けたら？」", "_t")
t("Blood, death without self-harm risks? Great fun!", "「痛い思いをせずに死闘を？　いいねいいね！」", "_t")
t("Normally you would be taken as a slave, but you look like you would be more useful as a full-time player, so you can just try again.", "　「普通なら奴隷になってもらう。だがお前はお得意様になってもらった方が良さそうだ。再挑戦すればいいさ」", "_t")
t([[Superb. Oh yes, before I forget, to use the orb you will need to pay the standard fee of 150 gold pieces.
I'm sure this is small money to an adventurer of your class.]], "　「決まりだな。おお、忘れる前に行っておく。操作オーブを使うならどなた様も１５０ゴールド払ってもらう決まりだ。お前ほどの冒険者なら端金だろうが」", "_t")
t("150 gold? Err... yes, sure.", "「１５０ゴールド？　うーん・・・わかったよ」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/ring-of-blood-orb.lua"

t([[#LIGHT_GREEN#*You place your hands on the orb.*#WHITE#
You must provide 150 gold to take part in the fight.]], "　オーブに手をかざした。ゲームには１５０ゴールドかかる。", "_t")
t("[Pay 150 gold]", "１５０ゴールド払う", "_t")
t("[Leave]", "立ち去る", "_t")
t("Let the fight start!", "　ゲーム開始！", "_t")
t("Bring it on!", "「行くぞ！」", "_t")

