section "mod-tome/data/chats/ring-of-blood-win.lua"

t([[So, you tasted blood? Liked it? I am sure you did; you are just that kind of people.
Anyway, I suppose you deserve your reward.
You can always participate again for fun, if you've got the gold to spare.]], "　「楽しんでくれたようだな？　感想は？　ああ、答えなくていい。お前はそういう奴さ。さて賞品を授与しよう。これからはいつでも遊びに来い。参加料はその都度払ってもらうが」", "_t")
t("Thanks, it was fun!", "どういたしまして。楽しかったよ！」", "_t")

