I take it you are satisfied with the portal.]], "　「ん？　ああ、お前か。どうだ、あのポータルは大したもんだろう！」", "_t")
t("Yes, thank you.", "「ええ、本当に」", "_t")
t("Whatever.", "「どうでもいい」", "chat_zemekkys-done")
-- old translated text
t("Whatever.", "「どうでもいい」", "_t")

