section "mod-tome/data/general/events/cultists.lua"

t("monolith", "モノリス", "_t")
t("Cultist", "邪教徒", "_t")
t("An elven cultist. He doesn't seem to mind you.", "　エルフの邪教徒だ。こちらには気を留めていないようだ。", "_t")
t("My soul for her!", "この魂はあの方のもの！", "_t")
t("The Dark Queen shall reign!", "来たれ闇の女王！", "_t")
t("Take me! Take me!", "この命を！　捧げます！", "_t")
t("From death comes life!", "死を以て生は出ずる！", "_t")
t("corrupted monolith", "邪悪なモノリス", "_t")
t("This is too soon!", "早すぎる！", "_t")
t("No the ritual will weaken!", "ああ！　儀式が台無しだ！", "_t")
t("disrupted monolith", "不完全なモノリス", "_t")
t("Something the cultists are doing is coming. Beware.", "　邪教徒たちの企みが実を結ぼうとしているようだ。気を付けろ。", "_t")
t("The cultist's soul seems to be absorbed by the strange stone he was guarding. You feel like something is about to happen...", "　邪教徒の魂が、守護していたモノリスに吸収されたようだ。何か起こりそうな気がする・・・", "_t")
t("This demon would be very attractive if not for the hovering crown of flames, the three tails and sharp claws. As you watch her you can almost feel pain digging in your flesh. She wants you to suffer.", "　見惚れるほど魅力的な姿をしたデーモンだ。宙を舞う炎の冠と三つの尻尾それに鋭い鉤爪を有してはいるが。彼女を見ていると体中に痛みが走るような感覚すら覚える。向こうはこちらを玩具にするつもりだ。", "_t")
t("and used for her perverted desires", "邪な欲望のはけ口にされた。", "_t")
t("Crown of Burning Pain", "★煉獄の宝冠", "_t")
t("burning crown", "燃える王冠", "_t")
t("This crown of pure flames possesses a myriad of small molten rocks floating wildly above it. Each can be removed to throw as a true meteor.", "　炎でできた冠だ。上には無数の小石が燃え盛りながら旋回している。その一つ一つが隕石となって敵に襲いかかるのだ。", "_t")
t([[A terrible shout thunders across the level: 'Come my darling, come, I will be ssssooo *nice* to you!'
You should flee from this level!]], [[　恐ろしい声が辺りに響く。
　「こっちにいらっしゃい。最高の快楽をあげるわ！」
　すぐにここから立ち去ろう！]], "_t")
t("%s pulls a dagger and opens his own chest, piercing his beating heart. The stone glows with malevolent colors.", "%sは短剣を取り出し、胸を裂いて、心臓を貫いた。石が悪しき光を放つ。", "logSeen")

