t("10% chance to shimmer to a different hue and gain powers", "１０％の確率で光を放ち、色が変化して性能が変わる。", "_t")
t("Ureslak's %s Femur", "★ウレスラック%sメイス", "tformat")
t("#GOLD#Ureslak's Femur glows and shimmers!", "#GOLD#ウレスラックの骨が輝く！", "logSeen")
t("Flaming", "豪炎", "_t")
t("Frozen", "凍結", "_t")
