t("#LIGHT_BLUE#You feel the power of the Way within you!", "#LIGHT_BLUE#「道」の力を宿した！", "logPlayer")
t("#RED#The Way rejects its former captors!", "#RED#「道」がかつての侵略者共を受け入れる道理がない！", "logPlayer")
