t("@Target@ is blasted with anti-magic forces!", "@Target@は反魔法の力を浴びた！", "_t")
t("dull area", "重苦しいエリア", "_t")
t("Deals up to %d manaburn damage, draining mana, vim, and positive and negative energies within radius %d.", "　魔素燃焼をダメージを最大で%d受ける。半径%dマスのキャラクターはマナ、精気、陽光力、月光力を奪われる。", "tformat")
t("dragon fire trap", "ドラゴンファイア", "entity name")
t("A powerful blast of fire impacts @target@!", "@target@を強烈な爆炎を食らった！", "_t")
