low diamond yield this year - +50% charge? ziguranth raided our last ang. caravan - more guards? - D.
yes to diamonds. arm our merchants in the caravan, no extra guards. profits are thin enough as it is! - S.]], [[　鉄の王座貿易台帳　対連合王国

　発展の時代　１２１



　最後の希望の都

