section "mod-tome/data/quests/anti-antimagic.lua"

t("The fall of Zigur", "ジグランスの落日", "_t")
t("You decided to side with the Grand Corruptor and joined forces to assault the Ziguranth main base of power.", "　腐敗の導師に与してジグランスの本拠地を襲撃する部隊に参加した。", "_t")
t("The Grand Corruptor died during the attack before he had time to teach you his ways.", "　襲撃の最中、腐敗の導師は命を落とし、彼の技を学ぶことはできなかった。", "_t")
t("The defenders of Zigur were crushed, the Ziguranth scattered and weakened.", "　ジガーを守る者たちは滅び、ジグランスは見る影もなく凋落した。", "_t")
t("In the aftermath you turned against the Grand Corruptor and dispatched him.", "　その後、導師に反旗を翻し、これを討ち果たした。", "_t")
t("Select the party member to receive the hexes generic talent tree:", "　呪い系タレントツリーを習得するキャラを選んでください。", "_t")
t("Grand Corruptor", "腐敗の導師", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#The Grand Corruptor gazes upon you. You feel knowledge flowing in your mind. You can now train some corruption powers.", "#LIGHT_GREEN#腐敗の導師の視線がこちらを貫く。頭の中に知識が流れ込んできた。腐敗の力を自分で少し鍛えられるようになった。", "_t")
t("Victory is mine!", "勝鬨を上げよ！", "_t")
t("While you were in the Far East, the Grand Corruptor was busy in Maj'Eyal.", "　東方にいる間、イヤルでは腐敗の導師が精力的に活動していた", "_t")
t("With the fall of Zigur he was able to attack and take control of Elvala, the Shaloren capital city.", "ジガーを攻め落とした後、シャローレの首都エルヴァラをも征服。", "_t")
t("His plans however do not stop there.", "しかし彼の野望は留まるところを知らない・・・", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
