t("You were asked to prove your worth as a fighter by a rogue, in order to participate in the arena", "　「戦士としての価値を証明して見せてくれ」と盗賊に依頼された。アリーナに誘う腹積もりだ。", "_t")
t("You succesfully defeated your adversaries and gained access to the arena!", "　三人の対戦相手を見事打ち負かし、アリーナで戦えるようになった！", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/arena.lua"

t("The Arena", "アリーナ", "_t")
t("Seeking wealth, glory, and a great fight, you challenge the Arena!", "　富と名誉。そして強敵を求めてアリーナに挑戦！", "_t")
t("Can you defeat your foes and become Master of Arena?", "　全ての敵を打ち負かし、チャンピオンになれるだろうか？", "_t")
t("Winner", "勝利", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Well done! You have won the Arena: Challenge of the Master#WHITE#", "#GOLD#　お見事！　アリーナの王者の座に就いた！#WHITE#", "_t")
t("You valiantly fought every creature the arena could throw at you and you emerged victorious!", "　アリーナにおけるあらゆる敵と勇猛果敢に戦い、勝ち抜いた！", "_t")
t("Glory to you, you are now the new master and your future characters will challenge you.", "　チャンピオンに栄光あれ。次回以降、このキャラクターがチャンピオンとして待ち受けるぞ！", "_t")
