section "mod-tome/data/quests/infinite-dungeon.lua"

t("The Infinite Dungeon", "無限迷宮", "_t")
t("You have entered the Infinite Dungeon. There is no going back now.", "　無限迷宮に足を踏み入れた。もう後戻りはできない。", "_t")
t("Go deep, fight, win or die in a blaze of glory!", "　進み、戦い、勝て！　あるいは見事な死に様を見せるか！", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/keepsake.lua"

t("Keepsake", "過去を後に", "_t")
t("You have begun to look for a way to overcome the curse that afflicts you.", "　我が身を蝕む呪い。この呪いを解く術を探し求めている。", "_t")
t("You have found a small iron acorn which you keep as a reminder of your past.", "　小さな鉄のドングリを見つけた。過去を見つめ直すために持っておくことにする。", "_t")
t("You have destroyed the merchant caravan that you once considered family.", "　キャラバンを皆殺しにした。かつては家族同然に思っていたのだが。", "_t")
t("Kyless, the one who brought the curse, is dead by your hand.", "　この身を呪いに侵したキレスに手を下した。", "_t")
t("Berethh is dead, may he rest in peace.", "　ベレスを手にかけた。彼の魂よ、安らかなれ。", "_t")
t("Your curse has changed the iron acorn which now serves as a cruel reminder of your past and present.", "　呪いの力が鉄のドングリに移った。これまでの自分に対する戒めとなっている。", "_t")
t("You have found a small iron acorn which you keep as a reminder of your past", "　小さな鉄のドングリを見つけた。過去を見つめ直すために持っておくことにする。", "_t")
t("Your curse has defiled the iron acorn which now serves as a reminder of your vile nature.", "　呪いの力が鉄のドングリを侵した。己が醜い本性を如実に物語るものとなっている。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#You need to find Berethh, the last person who may be able to help you.", "#LIGHT_GREEN#　ベレスを探そう。もう頼れそうな相手は彼しかいない。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#Seek out Kyless' cave in the northern part of the meadow and end him. Perhaps the curse will end with him.", "#LIGHT_GREEN#　牧草地の北にある洞窟へ向かい、キレスの息の根を止めよう。そうすればこの呪いも解けるかもしれない。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#Discover the meaning of the acorn and the dream.", "#LIGHT_GREEN#　このドングリとあの夢には一体どんな意味があるのだろう。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#You may have to revist your past to unlock some secret buried there.", "#LIGHT_GREEN#　自らの過去を見つめ直し、何があったのか探るべきか。", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#The time has come to learn the true nature of your curse.", "#VIOLET#この呪いの本質を掴む時が来た。", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#You find yourself in a dream.", "#VIOLET#ここは夢の中だ。", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#Your hate surges. You refuse to succumb to death!", "#VIOLET#憎悪が滾る。死ぬものか！", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#You have discovered a small iron acorn, a link to your past.", "#VIOLET#小さな鉄のドングリを見つけた。これは自分と関係のあるものだ。", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#The merchant caravan from the past has appeared in your dream.", "#VIOLET#夢の中にキャラバンが昔の姿のままで現れた。", "logPlayer")
t("Last of the Caravan", "キャラバン最後の一人", "_t")
t("secret path to the cave", "洞窟への隠し道", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#You have begun your hunt for Kyless!", "#VIOLET#さあ、キレスを討ち取ろう！", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#You have a marker to the entrance of Kyless' cave!", "#VIOLET#石碑がある。ここがキレスの洞窟だ！", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#You have found the entrance to Kyless' cave!", "#VIOLET#洞窟の入り口だ！", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#You have found the entrance to a vault!", "#VIOLET#ここにキレスの宝が隠してある！", "logPlayer")
t("#VIOLET#The shadows have noticed you!", "#VIOLET#影のようなものがこちらに気づいた！", "logPlayer")
t("A Second Vault", "二つ目の宝物庫", "_t")
t("You recognize this door as the entrance to a second vault. There are some scuffling noises and heavy breathing coming from the other side of the door.", "　この先にもキレスは戦利品を運び込んでいた。ドアの向こうから足を引きずるような音と、荒い息遣いが聞こえる。", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#You have found Kyless. You must destroy him.", "#VIOLET#キレスだ。奴の息の根を止めろ。", "logPlayer")
t("Death of Kyless", "キレスに止めを", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#Kyless is dead.", "#VIOLET#キレスは死んだ。", "logPlayer")
t("Berethh", "ベレス", "_t")
t("#VIOLET#Berethh lies dead.", "#VIOLET#ベレスは命を落とした。", "logPlayer")
-- old translated text
t("You recoginize this door as the entrance to a second vault. There are some scuffling noises and heavy breathing coming from the other side of the door.", "　この先にもキレスは戦利品を運び込んでいた。ドアの向こうから足を引きずるような音と、荒い息遣いが聞こえる。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/kryl-feijan-escape.lua"

t("The Sect of Kryl-Feijan", "クリル・フェイヤンの信徒達", "_t")
t("You discovered a sect worshipping a demon named Kryl-Feijan in a crypt.", "　霊廟にて邪教の一派に遭遇した。クリル・フェイヤンなるデーモンを信奉している。", "_t")
t("They were trying to bring it back into the world using a human sacrifice.", "　邪教徒共は人間を生贄にして、かのデーモンを蘇らせようとしていた。", "_t")
t("You defeated the acolytes and saved the woman. She told you she is the daughter of a rich merchant of Last Hope.", "　神官たちを討ち、生贄の少女を救出した。都に住む、豪商の娘だそうだ。", "_t")
t("You failed to protect her when escorting her out of the crypt.", "　生贄の少女を救出したが、霊廟を出る途中で死なせてしまった。", "_t")
t("You failed to defeat the acolytes in time - the woman got torn apart by the demon growing inside her.", "　神官たちを阻めなかった。少女の体内からデーモンが生まれ、その体を引き裂いた。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/lichform.lua"

t("From Death, Life", "不死なる命", "_t")
t("The affairs of this mortal world are trifling compared to your true goal: To conquer death.", "　俗世のいざこざなど、この計画の前では些事に過ぎない。死を超越するのだ。", "_t")
t("Your studies have uncovered much surrounding this subject, but now you must prepare for your glorious rebirth.", "　不死術に関しての研究はほぼ完成した。だが、大いなる転生の為に前準備が不可欠だ。", "_t")
t("You will need:", "　以下が転生の条件だ。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You are experienced enough.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#・実力は十分だ。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* The ceremony will require that you are worthy, experienced, and possessed of a certain amount of power (level 25, Magic over 50, Willpower over 25 and one prodigy point available).#WHITE#", "#SLATE#*　リッチ化の儀式にはそれにふさわしい技量と一定の力が求められる（レベル２５、魔力５０、意志２５、奥義ポイント１点）#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have 'extracted' the heart of one of your fellow necromancers.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#・同輩たる死霊術師の心臓を「摘出」した。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* The beating heart of a powerful necromancer.#WHITE#", "#SLATE#・生きたまま脈打つ、強大な死霊術師の心臓を手に入れよう。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* Yiilkgur the Sher'tul Fortress is a suitable location.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#・イールクガールは転生の儀式を行うにふさわしい。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* Yiilkgur has enough energy.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#・転生に必要なエネルギーが溜まった。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_GREEN#* You are now on the path of lichdom.#WHITE#", "#LIGHT_GREEN#・転生の条件は揃った。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* Use the control orb of Yiilkgur to begin the ceremony.#WHITE#", "#SLATE#・コントロールオーブを操作して転生の儀式を始めよう。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* Your lair must amass enough energy to use in your rebirth (40 energy).#WHITE#", "#SLATE#・城塞に十分なエネルギーを溜めなければ（エネルギー４０）#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#SLATE#* The ceremony will require a suitable location, secluded and given to the channelling of energy#WHITE#", "#SLATE#・転生の儀式はエネルギーを集めるのに適した場所で行う必要がある。人目につかない、自分だけの場所で。#WHITE#", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#* You have ascended to Lichdom!#WHITE#", "#CRIMSON#*　ついに不死の生を得た！#WHITE#", "_t")
t("Lichform", "リッチ化", "_t")
t("The secrets of death lay open to you! You are to become a Lich upon your next death!", "　不死の秘密を解き明かした！　次に死亡したときにリッチに転生する！", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/lightning-overload.lua"

t("Storming the city", "雷雲渦巻くダース", "_t")
t("As you approached Derth you saw a huge dark cloud over the small town.", "　ダースの方に向かっていると、行く先に巨大な暗雲が立ち込めていた。", "_t")
t("When you entered you were greeted by an army of air elementals slaughtering the population.", "　街に入ると風のエレメンタルが住民を殺して回っている。", "_t")
t(" * You have dispatched the elementals but the cloud lingers still. You must find a powerful ally to remove it. There are rumours of a secret town in the mountains, to the southwest. You could also check out the Ziguranth group that is supposed to fight magic.", "・エレメンタルは始末したが雷雲は晴れない。この件に対処できる人物を探さないと。南西の山間に隠れ里があるという噂だ。魔法使いと戦う組織、ジグランスを当たってみてもいい。", "_t")
t(" * You have learned the real threat comes from a rogue Archmage, a Tempest named Urkis. The mages of Angolwen are ready to teleport you there.", "・アンゴルウェンから離反した魔法使い、テンペストのアーキスがこの事件の黒幕だった。アンゴルウェンの術師たちに頼めば奴のところへテレポートさせてもらえる。", "_t")
t(" * You have learned the real threat comes from a rogue Archmage, a Tempest. You have been shown a secret entrance to his stronghold.", "テンペストの魔導士、アーキスがこの事件の黒幕だった。奴の住処に通じる裏道を教えてもらった。", "_t")
t(" * You have slain Urkis.  Return to Angolwen or Zigur for a reward.", "・アーキスを討伐した。アンゴルウェンなりジガーなりに戻り、報酬を貰おう。", "_t")
t(" * Urkis has been dealt with. Permanently.", "・アーキスはもう問題を起こさない。永久に。", "_t")
t("Scared Halfling", "怯えるハーフリング", "_t")
t("Danger...", "やばいな・・・", "_t")
t([[You step out on unfamiliar grounds. You are nearly on top of one of the highest peaks you can see.
The storm is raging above your head.]], "　見知らぬ地に足を踏み入れた。マイ・イヤル屈指の高峰。その頂上付近にいるようだ。頭上では嵐が吹き荒れている。", "_t")
t([[As you arrive in Derth you notice a huge dark cloud hovering over the town.
You hear screams coming from the town square.]], "　ダースが近づくにつれ、空に巨大な暗雲が立ち込めているのが見えてきた。街の広場から人々の悲鳴が聞こえてくる。", "_t")
t("Clear sky", "晴天", "_t")
t([[It seems the Ziguranth have kept their word.
Derth is free of the storm cloud.]], "　ジグランスは約束を果たしたようだ。ダースの空は晴れ渡っている。", "_t")
t([[It seems the mages have kept their word.
Derth is free of the storm cloud.]], "　魔法使い達は約束を果たしたようだ。ダースの空は晴れ渡っている。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/lost-merchant.lua"

t("Trapped!", "閉じ込められた！", "_t")
t("You heard a plea for help and decided to investigate...", "　助けを呼ぶ声が聞こえ、調査してみることにした。", "_t")
t("Only to find yourself trapped inside an unknown tunnel complex.", "　だが謎の地下道から出られなくなってしまう。", "_t")
t("A stairway out appears at your feet. The Lord says: 'And remember, you are MINE. I will call you.'", "暗殺組織の首領「いいか。俺の言うことには絶対服従だ。用があれば呼ぶからな」", "logPlayer")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#The merchant thanks you for saving his life. He gives you 8 gold and asks you to meet him again in Last Hope.", "#LIGHT_BLUE#「君は命の恩人だよ！」商人は謝礼に８ゴールドくれた。都に店を構えているそうだ。", "logPlayer")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/love-melinda.lua"

t("Melinda, lucky girl", "ラッキーガール・メリンダ", "_t")
t("After rescuing Melinda from Kryl-Feijan and the cultists you met her again in Last Hope.", "　クリル・フェイヤンの信奉者共から救出したメリンダと、都で再会した。", "_t")
t("Melinda was saved from the brink of death at the beach, by a strange wave of blight.", "　海辺でメリンダは九死に一生を得た。不思議なことに腐敗の力を放ったのだ。", "_t")
t("Melinda died to a Yaech raiding party at the beach.", "　ヤックの襲撃を受けてメリンダは死亡した。", "_t")
t("The Fortress Shadow said she could be cured.", "　城塞の執事によるとメリンダを治療できそうだ。", "_t")
t("Melinda decided to come live with you in your Fortress.", "　メリンダと一緒に城塞で暮らすことになった。", "_t")
t("The Fortress Shadow has established a portal for her so she can come and go freely.", "　城塞の執事はメリンダが自由に行き来できるポータルを用意してくれた。", "_t")
t("After your victory you came back to Last Hope and reunited with Melinda, who after many years remains free of demonic corruption.", "　冒険が終わった後、あなたはメリンダと再会した。月日は流れ、彼女も魔神の呪縛からすっかり解放されている。", "_t")
t("You lived together and led a happy life. Melinda even learned a few adventurer's tricks and you both traveled Eyal, making new legends.", "　あなたとメリンダは共に幸せな生涯を送った。メリンダも冒険者技術の一端を学び、二人でイヤルを旅して新たな伝説を築いていった。", "_t")
t("Melinda", "メリンダ", "_t")
t("You saved her from the depth of a cultists' lair and fell in love with her. She has moved into the Fortress to see you more often.", "　メリンダを邪教徒の魔窟から救い出し、恋に落ちた。一緒にいられる時間を持てるようにシェール・タルの城塞で暮らすようになった。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/lumberjack-cursed.lua"

t("The beast within", "内なる獣", "_t")
t("You met a half-mad lumberjack fleeing a small village, rambling about an untold horror lurking there, slaughtering people.", "　半狂乱の樵に出会った。村落から逃げてきたという。恐ろしい何かが村人を殺しまわっていると訴えている。", "_t")
t("%d lumberjacks have died.", "死亡者数：%d", "tformat")
t("Small lumberjack village", "樵の村落", "_t")
t("He points in the direction of the Riljek forest to the north.", "樵は北側にあるリルジェックの森の方を指した。", "logPlayer")
t("Thanks", "どうも", "_t")
t("The remaining lumberjacks collect some gold to thank you (%0.2f).", "　生き残った樵たちが寸志を出し合ってくれた（%0.2fゴールド）", "tformat")
t("You saved %s of us, please take this as a reward. (They give you %s)", "　%s少ないですがこれを（%sゴールド貰った）", "tformat")
t("all", "全", "quest_lumberjack")
t("most", "おかげさまで被害は最小限で済みました。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_RED#A lumberjack falls to the ground, dead.", "#LIGHT_RED#樵が倒れ、息を引き取った。", "logSeen")
-- old translated text
t("all", "全", "_t")

