section "mod-tome/data/quests/orb-command.lua"

t("The Orbs of Command", "四つの宝珠", "_t")
t("You have found an orb of command that seems to be used to open the shield protecting the High Peak.", "　支配の宝珠を手に入れた。これを使えば遥かなる頂の結界を解除できるらしい。", "_t")
t("There seems to be a total of four of them. The more you have the weaker the shield will be.", "　宝珠は全部で４つあるようだ。集めればそれだけ結界が弱まる。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#There is a loud crack. The way is open.", "#LIGHT_BLUE#凄い亀裂音がした。道が開いたぞ。", "logPlayer")

