section "mod-tome/data/quests/temporal-rift.lua"

t("Back and Back and Back to the Future", "バック×３トゥザフューチャー", "_t")
t([[After passing through some kind of time anomaly you met a temporal warden who told you to destroy the abominations of this alternate timeline.
]], [[　ある種の時空アノーマリーを抜けていくと、時の守護者に出会った。この別時間軸に存在する化物共を倒してくれとのことだ。
]], "_t")
t("Temporal Warden", "時の守護者", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/quests/trollmire-treasure.lua"

t("Hidden treasure", "隠し財宝", "_t")
t("You have found all the clues leading to the hidden treasure. There should be a way on the third level of the Trollmire.", "　隠し財宝の手がかりが全て集まった。トロル沼の三層目に入り口がある。", "_t")
t("It looks extremely dangerous, however - beware.", "　だが大変危険な場所のようだ。用心しろ。", "_t")
t("You have slain Bill. His treasure is yours for the taking.", "　ビルの息の根を止めた。奴の財宝は好きにしていい。", "_t")
t("way to the hidden trollmire treasure", "隠し財宝の在処へ", "_t")
t("Beware!", "注意！", "_t")
t("Danger...", "やばいな・・・", "_t")
t("This way leads to the lair of a mighty troll. Traces of blood are everywhere. Are you sure?", "　この先は恐ろしいトロルの棲家だ。そこら中に血の跡が残っている。覚悟は良いか？", "_t")
t("The way to the treasure is to the east. But beware, death probably awaits there.", "　ここから東に宝が隠されている。だが心せよ。危険も大きい。", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
