t("Nature heals and cleans you.", "　大地の力で癒されます。", "_t")
t("antimagic", "反魔法", "talent type")
t("The way to combat magic, or even nullify it.", "　魔法と戦う技術です。無効化することすらできます。", "_t")
t("summoning (melee)", "戦闘召喚", "talent type")
t("The art of calling creatures adept in melee combat to your aid.", "　近接戦闘に長けた生物を呼び出し、味方につける技術です。", "_t")
t("summoning (distance)", "元素召喚", "talent type")
t("The art of calling creatures adept in elemental destruction to your aid.", "　元素攻撃に長けた生物を呼び出し、味方につける技術です。", "_t")
t("summoning (utility)", "特殊召喚", "talent type")
t("The art of calling versatile creatures to your aid.", "　いろいろな能力を有した生物を呼びだし、味方につける技術です。", "_t")
t("summoning (augmentation)", "召喚操作", "talent type")
t("The art of manipulating the lifespan and location of your summons.", "　召喚生物の持続力と位置を操作する技術です。", "_t")
t("summoning (advanced)", "上級召喚", "talent type")
t("The art of improving the quality of your summons.", "　召喚生物を強化する技術です。", "_t")
t("slime", "粘体", "talent type")
t("Through dedicated consumption of slime mold juice, you have gained an affinity with slime molds.", "　ひたすらスライムモルドジュースを飲んだ結果、スライムモルドに似た体質を得ました。", "_t")
t("fungus", "胞子", "talent type")
t("By covering yourself in fungus, you better your healing.", "　体を菌類で覆い、回復力を高めます。", "_t")
t("sand drake aspect", "砂竜", "talent type")
t("Take on the defining aspects of a Sand Drake.", "　サンドドラゴンの形態をとります。", "_t")
