t("Take on the aspects of aged and powerful dragons.", "　年経た強大なドラゴンの形態をとります。", "_t")
t("mindstar mastery", "理刃", "talent type")
t("Learn to channel your mental power through mindstars, forming powerful psionic blades.", "　マインドスターに精神力を送り込み、強力な理力の刃を形成する技術を学びます。", "_t")
t("mucus", "分泌", "talent type")
t("Cover the floor with natural mucus.", "地面を粘液で覆います。", "_t")
t("ooze", "不定体", "talent type")
t("Your body and internal organs are becoming more ooze-like in nature, allowing you to spawn more of you.", "　体の内外に渡ってウーズの性質に近づきます。これにより、自身の分体を生み出せます。", "_t")
t("moss", "苔", "talent type")
t("You learn to control moss, making it grow at will to help you on the battlefield.", "苔を操り、思いのままに繁殖させ、戦闘補助に用いる技術を習得します。", "_t")
t("malleable body", "構造変位", "talent type")
t("Your body's anatomy is starting to blur.", "　臓器系が一体となっていきます。", "_t")
