t("You channel acid through your psiblades.", "　サイブレードに酸が流れ込みます。", "_t")
t("eyal's fury", "大激", "talent type")
t("Unleash nature's fury against foes around you.", "　周囲の敵へ大地の怒りを解き放ちます。", "_t")
t("earthen power", "大地力", "talent type")
t("Dwarves have learned to imbue their shields with the power of stone itself.", "　ドワーフ達は他ならぬ鉱石に宿る力を盾に込める術を体得しています。", "_t")
t("earthen vines", "石蔦", "talent type")
t("Control the stone itself and bring it alive in the form of dreadful vines.", "　鉱石を操り、命を与えて恐るべき蔦を作り上げます", "_t")
t("dwarven nature", "鉱身", "talent type")
t("Learn to harness the innate power of your race.", "　ドワーフに生来備わった力を制御します。", "_t")
t("#PINK#You can manage a maximum of %d summons at any time. You need %d Cunning to increase your limit.", "#PINK#%d体までの召喚生物を保持できます。賢さがあと %d 上昇すると保持上限が１増えます。", "logPlayer")
