section "mod-tome/data/zones/ancient-elven-ruins/objects.lua"

t("ancient papyrus scroll", "古代のパピルスの巻物", "entity name")
t("This seems to be an account of the last days of a great Shaloren mage.", "　シャローレの大術師が晩年に書いた所見のようだ。", "_t")
t("Bindings of Eternal Night", "★永夜の呪縛", "entity name")
t("blackened, slithering mummy wrappings", "黒ずんだ蠢く包帯", "_t")
t("Woven through with fell magics of undeath, these bindings suck the light and life out of everything they touch. Any who don them will find themselves suspended in a nightmarish limbo between life and death.", "徹頭徹尾、邪悪な不死の魔法を用いて編んだ包帯だ。触れるものから片っ端に光と命を吸い取ってしまう。これを纏う者は皆、背筋も凍る生と死の狭間に身を置くことになる。", "_t")
t("A complementing item would be your crowning glory.", "大いなる冠を戴けば、全てが整う。", "_t")
t("Crown of Eternal Night", "★永夜の冠", "entity name")
t("blackened crown", "黒ずんだ冠", "_t")
t("This crown looks useless, yet you can feel it is woven with fell magics of undeath. Maybe it has a use.", "この冠はガラクタに見えるが、それでも邪悪な不死の魔力を宿しているのが分かる。何か使い道があるのかも。", "_t")
t("You need to find something to bind its powers.", "この力を封じ込める物が必要だ。", "_t")
t("#ANTIQUE_WHITE#The Crown of Eternal Night seems to react with the Bindings, you feel tremendous dark power.", "#ANTIQUE_WHITE#冠が包帯と感応している。凄まじい闇の力だ。", "logSeen")
t("#ANTIQUE_WHITE#The powerful darkness aura you felt wanes away.", "#ANTIQUE_WHITE#強烈な闇の力が消えていった。", "logPlayer")

