t("Kryl-Feijan", "クリル・フェイヤン", "entity name")
t("This huge demon is covered in darkness. The ripped flesh of its \"mother\" still hangs from its sharp claws.", "　闇を纏う巨大デーモンだ。鋭い爪には「母体」の血肉がまだこびりついている。", "_t")
t("and devoured as a demonic breakfast", "そして、デーモンたちの餌食になり", "_t")
t("Melinda", "メリンダ", "entity name")
t("humanoid", "人型", "entity type")
t("human", "人間", "entity subtype")
t("A female Human with twisted sigils scored into her naked flesh. Her wrists and ankles are sore and hurt by ropes and chains. You can discern great beauty beyond the stains of blood covering her skin.", "　人間の女性だ。嫌な感じの文様がその裸体に描かれている。両の手首足首はロープと鎖に擦れて傷ついている。血を浴びているが、大変な美貌の持ち主だと見て取れる。", "_t")
t("Acolyte of the Sect of Kryl-Feijan", "クリル・フェイヤンの侍者", "entity name")
t("elf", "エルフ", "entity subtype")
t("Black-robed Elves with a mad look in their eyes.", "　黒いローブを着たエルフだ。瞳には狂気が宿っている。", "_t")
t("Melinda", "メリンダ", "_t")
t([[The woman seems to be freed from her bonds.
She stumbles on her feet, her naked body still dripping in blood. 'Please get me out of here!']], [[　生贄の女性が自由になったようだ。足元はフラフラで、裸体からはまだ血が滴っている。
　「お願い！　外へ連れてって！」]], "_t")

