t("The Abomination", "バケモノ", "entity name")
t("A horrid mass of pustulent flesh, sinew, and bone; this creature seems to constantly be in pain. Two heads glare malevolently at you, an intruder in its domain.", "　腫瘍状の肉と筋、そして骨が合わさった巨塊だ。絶え間なく痛みに苛まされているらしい。二つの頭がテリトリーの侵入者たるこちらを、憎々しげに睨んでいる。", "_t")
t("A parchment falls to the floor near The Abomination.", "「バケモノ」の傍に羊皮紙が落ちた。", "logSeen")

