section "mod-tome/data/zones/golem-graveyard/grids.lua"

t("the remains of Atamathon", "壊れたアタマトン", "entity name")
t([[This giant golem was constructed by the Halflings during the Pyre Wars to fight the orcs, but was felled by Garkul the Devourer.
Its body is made of marble, its joints of solid voratun, and its sole eye of purest ruby; the other one seems to be missing. At over 40 feet tall, it towers above you.
Someone foolish has tried to reconstruct it, but was unable to complete the task; the golem needs another eye to be complete.]], "　この巨大ゴーレムは篝火の戦いにおいてハーフリング達が対オーク兵器として製造したものだ。だが大喰らいガークルによって破壊されてしまう。体は大理石、関節部は強固なヴォラタン製で片目は超高純度のルビーだ。もう片方の目は無くなっている。１２ｍもの巨体だ。どこかの馬鹿が修復しようとしたらしいが、未完に終わっている。文字通り、点睛を欠いた状態だ。", "_t")
t("Atamathon", "アタマトン", "_t")
t("It seems that your %s is made to fit inside the empty eye socket of Atamathon. This is probably very unwise.", "　%sが空いた眼窩に収まりそうだ。だがそれは愚かしい行為と言えよう。", "tformat")
t("The socket seems broken.", "片目が壊れているようだ。", "log")
t("#LIGHT_RED#As you insert the gem the golem starts to shake. All its systems and magics are reactivating.", "#LIGHT_RED#眼窩に宝石をはめ込むとゴーレムが揺れた。全システムが再起動し、魔力が巡る。", "log")
t("#LIGHT_RED#Atamathon walks the world again, but without control.", "#LIGHT_RED#アタマトン再建せり。だが、コントロールを失っている。", "log")
t("Activating defenses. Targetting hostile. **DESTRUCTION**!", "防衛機能キドウ。敵ホソク。センメツシマス！", "_t")
t("Insert", "入れてみる", "_t")
t("Cancel", "キャンセル", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/zones/golem-graveyard/npcs.lua"

t("Atamathon the Giant Golem", "巨大ゴーレム・アタマトン", "entity name")
t("This giant golem was constructed by the Halflings during the Pyre Wars to fight the orcs, but was felled by Garkul the Devourer. Someone foolish has tried to reconstruct it, but has lost control of it, and now it rampages in search of its original creators, who are long dead. Its body is made of marble, its joints of solid voratun, and its eyes of purest ruby. At over 40 feet tall, it towers above you, and its crimson orbs seem to glow with rage.", "　この巨大ゴーレムは篝火の戦いにおいてハーフリング達が対オーク兵器として製造したものだ。だが大喰らいガークルによって破壊されてしまう。どこかのマヌケが修復しようとしたが、制御を失ってしまった。とっくの昔に死んでしまった製作者を探し求め、暴れまわっているのだ。体は大理石、関節部は強固なヴォラタン製で目は超高純度のルビー。１２ｍの巨体が聳え立ち、深紅の両眼は怒りに燃えている。", "_t")
t("DESTROY!", "センメツ！", "_t")
t("LIFE-ENDING SYSTEMS ACTIVATED!", "サツリクシステムキドウ！", "_t")
t("GLORY TO THE HALFLINGS!", "はーふりんぐニショウリヲ！", "_t")
t("YOUR DEATH IS NECESSARY", "シンデモライマス！", "_t")
t("ACTIVATING PAIN GIVING SUBMODULES!", "ザンサツさぶもじゅーる　キドウ！", "_t")
t("YOUR LIFE WILL END, PLEASE DO NOT RESIST!", "モウオワリデス。テイコウハ　ヤメナサイ！", "_t")
t("RESISTANCE IS FUTILE, YOUR WILL BE EXTERMINATED!", "ムダナテイコウデス。オワラセマス！", "_t")
t("PLEASE STAY STEADY AS YOU ARE ERASED FROM THE WORLD!", "ウゴカナイデ！　マッショウシマス！", "_t")
t("EXECUTE PHASE COMMENCING!", "ショリふぇいずカイシ！", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
