t("Subject Z", "被検体Ｚ", "entity name")
t("humanoid", "人型", "entity type")
t("human", "人間", "entity subtype")
t("This seems to be the 'subject Z' the notes spoke about. He looks human, but this cannot be -- he would be about five thousand years old!", "　記録にあった被検体Ｚのようだ。姿形は人間に見えるが、普通の生き物であるはずがない。五千歳にもなるのだから！", "_t")
t("and bloodily smeared across the granite walls", "そして、花崗岩の壁に血が飛び散り", "_t")
