t("Stay and fight!", "一緒に戦う！", "_t")
t("Halfling?! DIE!!!!!", "ハーフリングか！？　死ね！！！", "_t")
t("The Way sent you?", "「道」の者か？", "_t")
t("You.. saved me?", "助けて・・・くれたのか？", "_t")
t("Yeek Wayist", "「道」のイーク", "entity name")
t("yeek", "イーク", "entity subtype")
t("This creature is about as tall as a halfling. It is covered in white silky fur and has a disproportionate head. The weirdest thing about it though, its weapon simply floats in front of it.", "　ハーフリング程の背丈の生き物だ。艶やかな白い毛で覆われており、不釣り合い頭が大きい。摩訶不思議なのはその武器だ。触れてもいないのに空中に浮かんでいる。", "_t")

