section "mod-tome/data/zones/high-peak/objects.lua"

t("bloodsoaked diamond", "血まみれのダイヤモンド", "entity name")
t("A strangely wet diamond.", "　不気味に濡れたダイヤモンドだ。", "_t")
t("bloodsoaked athame", "血まみれの短剣", "entity name")
t("A strangely wet athame.", "　不気味に濡れた儀式用の短剣だ。", "_t")
t("journal", "日記", "entity name")
t("A magically-preserved journal.", "　魔法の力で保存している日記だ。", "_t")
t("Awakened Staff of Absorption", "★吸魔の杖", "entity name")
t("ominous, dark runed staff", "ルーンを刻んだ不気味な黒い杖", "_t")
t([[Carved with runes of power, this staff seems to have been made long ago, yet it bears no signs of tarnish.
Light around it seems to dim and you can feel its tremendous power simply by touching it.
The Sorcerers seem to have awakened its power.
#{italic}#"And lo they came to Amakthel himself, and thousands were killed in the assault on his throne, and three of the Godslayers were broken beneath his feet. But Falion with his dying breath pierced the great god on his knee with the icy sword Arkil, and seeing his opportunity Caldizar, leader of the Godslayers, advanced with the Staff of Absorption and struck a terrifying blow against Amakthel. So fell the greatest of the gods by the hands of his own children, and his face was forced into the dust."#{normal}#]], [[力あるルーン文字が刻まれている。はるか昔に作られたもののようだが、傷一つない。周囲の光を吸い取ってしまうようで、触れただけでも強大な力を感じる。
　ソーサラー達の手によって真の力を取り戻しているようだ。
#{italic}#"　おお、彼らはついにアマクテルその人のもとへたどり着いた。数千名がかの玉座に攻め入って命を落とし、神殺しのうち３人がアマクテルの足元に斃れた。しかし今際の際のファリオンが、凍てつく剣アーキルで絶対神の膝頭を刺し貫くと、神殺しの長カルディザーは好機と見て、吸魔の杖を手に歩を進め、無常なる一撃を加えた。かくして絶対神は寵児らの手によって斃れ、その容は打ち砕かれたのである。#{normal}#]], "_t")
t("absorb the essence (ignoring resistance and bypassing most defenses) of a target in range %d, draining 30%% of its life and increasing your own damage by 30%% for %d turns", "対象の命を吸い取る（これは耐性およびほとんどの防御的能力を無視する）射程は%dマス。これにより対象のＨＰを３０％吸収し、自身の与ダメージが%dターンの間３０％増加する。", "tformat")
t("was absorbed by the %s held by %s", "%sの杖により%sに力を吸い取られてしまった。", "tformat")
t("#Source# brandishes %s %s, absorbing the essence of #target#!", "#Source#は%s%sを掲げた。#target#の命が吸い取られる！", "logCombat")
t("#ORCHID# %d essence drain#LAST#", "#ORCHID# %d　命吸収#LAST#", "tformat")
t("gem", "宝石", "entity type")
t("white", "白の宝石", "entity subtype")
t("Pearl of Life and Death", "★死生の真珠", "entity name")
t("shining pearl", "輝く真珠", "_t")
t("A pearl, three times the size of a normal pearl, that glitters in infinite colours, with slight patterns ever shifting away.", "　通常の３倍のサイズの真珠だ。虹色に輝いており、その光は微妙に変化しながら留まることがない。", "_t")

