t("#VIOLET#You suddenly understand how to channel your mental force through mindstars. (Mindstar Mastery category can be bought)", "#VIOLET#ふと、マインドスターに精神力を流し込む方法を閃いた（理刃ツリーをアンロック可能）", "logPlayer")
