section "mod-tome/data/zones/reknor/npcs.lua"

t("humanoid", "人型", "entity type")
t("orc", "オーク", "entity subtype")
t("Golbug the Destroyer", "壊しのゴルバグ", "entity name")
t("A huge and muscular orc of unknown breed. He looks both menacing and cunning...", "　筋骨隆々の巨大なオークだ。詳しい種別は解らない。狡賢そうだ・・・", "_t")
t("They say that after it has been confirmed orcs still inhabited Reknor, they found a mighty demon there.", "レクノールにオーク共が残っていたのは判ったが、大物デーモンもいるらしい。", "_t")
t("Danger...", "やばいな・・・", "_t")
t("When last you saw it, this cavern was littered with the corpses of orcs that you had slain. Now many, many more corpses carpet the floor, all charred and reeking of sulfur. An orange glow dimly illuminates the far reaches of the cavern to the east.", "　この前来たときは、自分で倒したオークの死体が散乱していた。今は無数の死体が床を埋めている。皆焼け焦げて、硫黄の臭いが鼻を衝く。東の方に遠くでオレンジ色の光が仄かに輝いている。", "_t")
t("human", "人間", "entity subtype")
t("Harno, Herald of Last Hope", "都の使者ハーノ", "entity name")
t("This is one of the heralds of Last Hope. He seems to be looking for you.", "　都の使者だ。こちらを探していたらしい。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_RED#You hear a death cry. '%s I have a messag... ARG!'", "#LIGHT_RED#断末魔が聞こえた。「%s殿、書簡をとどけ・・・グアッ！」", "logPlayer")
t("demon", "デーモン", "entity type")
t("major", "上級デーモン", "entity subtype")
t("Lithfengel", "リスフェンジェル", "entity name")
t("A terrible demon of decay and atrophy, drawn to the energy of the farportal. A beast of blight!", "　破壊と衰退のデーモンだ。大ポータルのエネルギーに引き付けられている。まさに腐敗の化身だ！", "_t")
t("Back and there again", "帰って行って", "_t")
t("A careful examination of the demon's body turns up a Blood-Runed Athame and a Resonating Diamond, both covered in soot and gore but otherwise in good condition.", "　デーモンの体を慎重に検めると、深紅ルーンの短剣と振動ダイヤが見つかった。煤と血で汚れてはいるが、状態は良好だ。", "_t")

