section "mod-tome/data/zones/temple-of-creation/zone.lua"

t("Temple of Creation", "創造の神殿", "_t")
t("#AQUAMARINE#You arrive deep under water, at the sea floor, as you look upwards you only see a glimpse of light coming through.", "#AQUAMARINE#深海の底にたどり着いた。顔を上げたが、ほんのわずかな光が射す他に何も見えない。", "logPlayer")
t("#AQUAMARINE#You should be crushed by the pressure, but strangely you feel no discomfort.", "#AQUAMARINE#水圧で潰れていてもおかしくないのだが・・・不思議なことに何の痛痒もない。", "logPlayer")
t("#AQUAMARINE#All around you there is only water as far as you can see, except to your left, a giant coral structure. This is probably the temple of Creation.", "#AQUAMARINE#周囲は見渡す限り水。だが左手に巨大な珊瑚の建造物がある。これが創造の神殿だろう。", "logPlayer")

