t("Strength", "腕力", "stat name")
t("str", "腕力", "stat short_name")
t("Strength defines your character's ability to apply physical force. It increases your melee damage, damage done with heavy weapons, your chance to resist physical effects, and carrying capacity.", "　腕力です。物理的な力を加える能力です。近接攻撃のダメージ、重武器を使用する際のダメージ、物理的な効果に対する抵抗力、運搬重量の上限に影響します。", "_t")
t("Dexterity", "機敏", "stat name")
t("dex", "機敏", "stat short_name")
t("Dexterity defines your character's ability to be agile and alert. It increases your chance to hit, your ability to avoid attacks, and your damage with light or ranged weapons.", "　機敏です。素早さと注意力に関する能力です。命中率、回避率、軽武器や射撃武器を使う際のダメージに影響します。", "_t")
t("Magic", "魔力", "stat name")
t("mag", "魔力", "stat short_name")
t("Magic defines your character's ability to manipulate the magical energy of the world. It increases your spell power, and the effect of spells and other magic items.", "　魔力です。この世界の魔法的なエネルギーを操作する能力です。魔法パワーおよび魔法と魔道具の効果に影響します。", "_t")
t("Willpower", "意志", "stat name")
t("wil", "意志", "stat short_name")
t("Willpower defines your character's ability to concentrate. It increases your mana, stamina and PSI capacity, and your chance to resist mental attacks.", "　意志、すなわち集中力です。マナ、スタミナ、Ｐｓｉの最大値と精神的な障害に対する抵抗力に影響します。", "_t")
t("Cunning", "賢さ", "stat name")
t("cun", "賢さ", "stat short_name")
t("Cunning defines your character's ability to learn, think, and react. It allows you to learn many worldly abilities, and increases your mental capabilities and chance of critical hits.", "　賢さです。学習能力と思考力、および対応力を表します。雑多な技能の習得および、精神的な能力とクリティカル率に影響します。", "_t")
t("Constitution", "耐久", "stat name")
t("con", "耐久", "stat short_name")
t("Constitution defines your character's ability to withstand and resist damage. It increases your maximum life and physical resistance.", "　耐久です。ダメージに耐え、抵抗する能力です。最大ＨＰと物理的な抵抗力に影響します。", "_t")
t("Luck", "運", "stat name")
t("lck", "運", "stat short_name")
t("Luck defines your character's fortune when dealing with unknown events. It increases your critical strike chance, your chance of random encounters, ...", "　運です。未知の事態に対処する際、どれだけ上手くいくかという能力です。クリティカル率やランダムイベントの発生などに関わります。", "_t")
